\pard\fi0\li0\tx285\tx720\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 -205\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22  [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Landulfus Sagax}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 :] {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Historia Romana}}\plain \f0\fs22 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 \u8250 \'9bIncipit liber primus Romane hystorie.\u8249 \'8b {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Primus in Italia, ut quibusdam placet, regnavit Janus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ... fugiens in civitate que ex eius nomine Saturnia dicta est latuit ... - ... reversus est et obsessam Andrianopolim cepit. Explicit liber xxvi Romane historie Deo gracias anno domini m\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs28 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  cccc\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs28 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  lxxi\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs28 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  in Kempen apud sorores Sancte Anne 3\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs28 ii\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ordinis Sancti Francisci excopiatus et consummatus.\plain \f0\fs22  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Ed.: Amedeo Crivel\-lucci (Hg.): Landolfi Sagacis Historia Romana (sec. X\endash XI). Roma 1912\endash 1913 (Fonti per la storia d\lquote Italia 49\endash 50). Zur \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. ebd., Bd. 1, S.\~LIII\endash LIV\plain \f0\fs22 . Am Rand vereinzelt Korrekturen von Schreiberhand sowie Glossen von anderer Hand, um 1500. 205\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 rb\plain \f0\fs22 -205\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22  leer.}

