\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 8\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 va\plain \f0\fs22 \endash 12\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Johannes Presbyter}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Epistula}}\plain \f0\fs22 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 \u8250 \'9bHec est epistola, quam misit presbiter Johannes domi\-nus tocius Indie ad dominum Manuelem Papam Rome, gubernatorem Romanorum\u8249 \'8b. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Per potentiam et virtutem ... Sciatis, o domine Manuel, quod multociens audivi dici}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ... \endash  ... scilicet in latitudine et longitudine, quam nemo potest existimare preter Deum celi. Qui est benedictus ... Amen.\plain \f0\fs22  Ed.: Oppert (s. o.), S. 167\endash 179; Zarncke (s. o.), S. 909\endash 934. Zu Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. Martin Gosman: La lettre du pr\u234 \'eatre Jean. Les versions en ancien fran\u231 \'e7ais et en ancien occitan. Diss. Groningen 1982, S. 3; 97 (Sonderform wie {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Berlin, SB, Ms. theol. lat. qu. 141}}\plain \f0\fs22 , 48\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 \endash 52\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 , vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 B SB Kat. 1.1}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 38f.); Friedrich Zarncke: Der Priester Johannes. 1. Abh. Leipzig 1879 (Abh. d. Kgl. S\u228 \'e4chs. Ges. d. Wiss. Philol.-hist. Kl. 7,8), S. 882-883; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 VL (2)}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Bd. 7, Sp.\~833 (Interpolation A).}

