\pard\fi0\li0\tx285\tx720\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 \endash 22\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 rb\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Quaestiones in [Johannis de Sacrobosco] Sphaeram materialem}}\plain \f0\fs22 . Sammlung von 21 Qu\u228 \'e4stionen. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Circa textum spere materialis queritur primo, utrum diffinicio spere prima in textu posita sit bona}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ... \endash  ... sic eciam ad oppositionem non sequitur eclipsis lune sed aliunde habent fieri ut visum est. Et hec de questionibus tractatus spere.\plain \f0\fs22  Mit Schemazeichnung am Rand. Der anonyme Verfasser folgt in der Titelformulierung den Quaestiones des Christianus de Ackoy (Berlin, SB, Ms. lat. fol. 631, 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 \endash 37\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 ; zum Verfasser {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Lohr, Commentaries Suppl.}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 130) und verwemdet Zitate von {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Johannes Peckham}}\plain \f0\fs22  (17\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 ) und {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Johannes Buridanus}}\plain \f0\fs22  (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22 . 10\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 rb\plain \f0\fs22 ). 22\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 rb\plain \f0\fs22  Nachtrag: [Nota de divisione multitudinum et de numero diabolorum elapsorum de caelo]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Nota. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Decies decem faciunt centum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  \u8230 \'85 \endash  ... septies mille et vingenti sex diaboli\plain \f0\fs22 . \u220 \'dcberlieferung auch {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Freiburg/Breisgau, UB, Hs. 1283}}\plain \f0\fs22 , 18\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 , vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 FR UB Kat. 1.3}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 184. Handwechsel.}

