\pard\fi0\li0\tx285\tx720\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 22\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 va\plain \f0\fs22 \endash 23\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Henricus de Runen}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Quaestio de celebratione paschae}}\plain \f0\fs22 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Queritur utrum in cele\-bracione pasce penes primariam ecclesie institucionem luminarium revolucio sit observanda}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ... \endash  ... est neganda patet ex pre\-cedentibus. Explicit Questio de celebracione pasce expedita et determinata per venerabilem virum magistrum Heynricum de Runen anno incarnacionis 1444 in quotlibeto honorabilis magistri Heynricis de Hyldesheym\plain \f0\fs22  [dann von der Hand des Ludolphus de Borchtorpe:] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 quando ego Ludolfus Borchtorp artis baccalarius responsalis eram ad questionem expectatoriam dictam anno 1445 ante Quadragesimam promotus fui in magistrum arcium liberalium Erfordie.\plain \f0\fs22  Zu Heinrich Runen vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Kleineidam, Universitas 1, 1985}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 418; zu den Erfurter Disputationes de quolibet und zu Heinrich (Dasle) von Hildesheim vgl. ebd., S. 250\endash 254; S. 418. Handwechsel.}

