\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\tx285\tx720\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 24\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 \endash 31\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 vd\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 [Pseudo-]Haly [Filius Abbas]:}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f0\fs22 [\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Centiloquium secundum antiquam et novam translationem {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Claudii Ptolemaei}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22  cum commento\plain \f0\fs22 . (24\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 ) Am Rand Titel von Borchtorpe: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Antiqua translatio Centilogii Ptholomei\plain \f0\fs22 . Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Mundanorum ad hoc et ad illud mutacio ex corporum celestium mutacione }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 (nachgetragen: }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 contingit}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 )}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ... Scientia namque stellarum ex te et ex illis est et non oportet peritum iudicare ... \endash  ... subiecti plurimum\plain \f0\fs22 . Angeschlossen, ohne Randvermerk: Translatio nova. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Dixit Ptholomeus. Iam scripsi tibi Jesure}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ... \endash  ... accipe ergo bono animo illum\plain \f0\fs22 . Angeschlossen, mit Randtitel von Borchtorpe: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Tertia translatio\plain \f0\fs22 . Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Doctrina stellarum ex te et ex illis nec est doctrina in ea}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ... \endash  ... fundamentum magne rei\plain \f0\fs22 . (24\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 rb\plain \f0\fs22 ) Translatio antiqua. Am Rand Titel von Borchtorpe: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Antiqua translatio sed incipit sic Mundanorum ad hoc etc. etc.\plain \f0\fs22  Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Scientia }}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 (nachgetragen: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 namque}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 ) }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 astrorum ex te et ex illis}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17  (ausgestrichen: }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 est}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 ) }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 et non oportet peritum illorum iudicare}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ... \endash  ... subiecti plurimum\plain \f0\fs22 . (24\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 rc\plain \f0\fs22 ) Am Rand Titel von Borchtorpe: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Nova translatio\plain \f0\fs22 , Fortsetzung. Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Scientia}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17  (ausgestrichen: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 astrorum etc.}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 ) }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 stellarum ex te et ex illis est. Astrologus non debet dicere rem specialiter}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ... \endash  ... habeant scientiam.\plain \f0\fs22  Angeschlossen: Kommentar des Ps.-Haly in lateinischer \u220 \'dcbersetzung. Am Rand Titel von Borchtorpe: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Commentum\plain \f0\fs22 . Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Quod dixit Ptolemeus: Ex te et ex illis est. Significat, quod, qui res futuras prenoscere desiderat, duabus viis oportet incedere}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ...\plain \f0\fs22  Textschl\u252 \'fcsse: (31\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 va\plain \f0\fs22 ) Translatio nova, bricht ab mit Verbum 99: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 ... habentes comas sunt de secundis stellarum et non sunt de illis\plain \f0\fs22 . (31\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 vc\plain \f0\fs22 ) Kommentar: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 ... in hoc libro Ptholomei iam probavimus et quanto melius quivimus exposuimus ... Et sic finitur illud commentum Hali super Centilogio vel Centiloquio Ptholomei secundum antiquam et novam translationes et autem triplicem pro quo sint Deo grates Sancte Marie et Sancte Katharine\plain \f0\fs22  (angeh\u228 \'e4ngt:) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 et omnibus sanctis Amen.\plain \f0\fs22  Translatio antiqua (31\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 vd\plain \f0\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 ... rebellis est de eodem climate. Deo gracias finitus est ille textus Centiloquii in vigilia nativitatis Christi similiter et commentum\plain \f0\fs22  (eingef\u252 \'fcgt: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 prope horam secundam\plain \f0\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 1444 completus\plain \f0\fs22 . Text der Translatio antiqua in der Mittelspalte (in Textualis), in den beiden Randspalten Translatio nova sowie Kommentar (in Kursive). Nur zum ersten \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 verbum\plain \f0\fs22  (24\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 -24\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 rc\plain \f0\fs22 ) alle drei \u220 \'dcbersetzungen vollst\u228 \'e4ndig und fortlaufend auch in den Randspalten. Zu den Verfassern, Texten (beide \u220 \'dcbersetzungen sowie Kommentar) und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. Richard Lemay: Origin and Success of the Kitab Thamara of Abu Ja\rquote far Amad ibn Yusuf ibn Ibrahim from the tenth to the seventeenth century in the world of Islam and the Latin West. In: Proceedings of the First International Symposium for the History of Arabic Science, April 5\endash 12, 1976. Bd. 2. Aleppo 1978, S. 91\endash 107; Charles Burnett: The Writings of Adelard of Bath and Closely Associated Works ... In: Charles Burnett (Hg.): Adelard of Bath. An English Scientist and Arabist of the Early TwelfthCentury. London 1987, S. 166 (Nr. 1; Hs genannt).}

