\pard\fi0\li0\tx285\tx720\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 37\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 \endash 38\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 [Pseudo-]Messahalah}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 De practica astrolabii}}\plain \f0\fs22 . Titel: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Incipit Practica astrolabii ...\plain \f0\fs22  Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Nomina instrumentorum sunt hec: Primum est armilla suspensoria ad capiendam altitudinem}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ... \endash  ... talis est comparacio stature tue ad planiciem. Et sic est finis huius ...\plain \f0\fs22  Ed.: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Gunther, Science 5, 1929}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 217-231. Zu Verfasser, Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Thorndike/Kibre, Catalogue of Incipits, 1963}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Sp. 916; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Kunitzsch, Authenticity, 1981}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 48\endash 56.}

