\pard\fi0\li0\tx285\tx720\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 39\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 \endash 45\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat18 Canones Azarchelis super tabulis Toletanis}}\plain \f0\fs22 . Titel: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 In nomine domini ... Incipiunt Canones Azarchelis ... super tabulis Toletanis.\plain \f0\fs22  Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat18 Quoniam cuiuslibet accionis quantitatem temporis metitur spacium}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ... \endash  ... cum universis gradibus usque ad perfeccionem 90 graduum et sic est finis 1446 incompletis 3\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs28 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  hora ipso die Vincentii et Epiphanii\plain \f0\fs22  [22. Jan. 1446]. Ed.: Fritz S. Pedersen: Canones Azarchelis: Some Versions, and a Text. In: Cahiers de l\lquote Institut du Moyen-\u194 \'c2ge grec et latin 54 (1987), S. 138\endash 212. Zu Text und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. ebd. S. 129\endash 137 (Gr. XTG); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat18 Thorndike/Kibre, Catalogue of Incipits, 1963}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Sp. 1268; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat18 Carmody,  Sciences, 1956}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 159 (Nr. 31.1.a). Mit 18 geometrischen Figuren; ohne Kapitel\u252 \'fcberschriften.}

