\pard\fi0\li0\tx285\tx720\tx1845\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 48\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 \endash 52\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Gerardus [de Sabloneta]}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Theorica planetarum}}\plain \f0\fs22 . Am Rand sechszeiliger Accessus (Anfang des Kommentars von Taddaeus de Parma, vgl. 187\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22 \endash 188\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 ). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Istius libri sub\-iectum est corpus celeste mobile ... Titulus est Theorica planetarum Gherhardi Cremonensis et qui dicitur fuisse de Cremona civitate et dicitur transtulisse totam medicinam ...\plain \f0\fs22  Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 \u8250 \'9bCirculus ecentricus }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 (!) }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 vel egresse cuspidis\u8249 \'8b vel egredientis centri dicitur, qui non habet centrum cum mundo}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ... \endash  ... coniuncti lumine ipsi planete et non corporaliter. Amen. Et in hoc terminatur Theorica planetarum. Deo gracias.\plain \f0\fs22  Mit 13 geometrischen Figuren zur Planetentheorie (s. o. 35bis\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 \endash 35ter\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 ). Ed.: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Carmody, Theorica, 1942}}\plain \f0\fs22 . Zu Verfasser, Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. ebd., S.\~167f. Zu Verfasser, Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Thorndike/Kibre, Catalogue of Incipits, 1963}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Sp. 223; Olaf Pedersen: The Origins of the \lquote Theorica planetarum\rquote . In: Journal for the History of Astronomy 12 (1981), S. 113\endash 123.}

