\pard\fi0\li0\tx285\tx720\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 53\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 \endash 56\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22  [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Johannes de Lineriis}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 :] {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Algorismus de minutiis}}\plain \f0\fs22 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 \u8250 \'9bAlgorismus de minutiis\u8249 \'8b. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Modum re\-pre\-sen\-ta\-cionis minuciarum volgarium }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 (!) }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 et phisicarum preponere}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ... \endash  ... quia sic ad propositum nostrum sufficiant minuciarum volgarium \plain \f0\fs22 (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 et phisicarum. Explicit Algorismus de minuciis pro quo laus et gloria sit Christo.\plain \f0\fs22  Ed.: Hubertus L. L. Busard: Het rekenen met breuken in de middeleeuwen, in het bijzonder bij Johannes de Lineriis. Br\u252 \'fcssel 1968 (Mededelingen van de Koninklijke Vlaamse Academie voor Wetenschappen, Letteren en schone Kunsten van Belgi\u235 \'eb. Kl. der Wetenschappen 30,7), S. 21\endash 36 (Hs nicht genannt). Zu Verfasser, Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Thorndike/Kibre, Catalogue of Incipits, 1963}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Sp. 878.}

