\pard\fi0\li0\tx285\tx720\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 56\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 \endash 59\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22  [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Johannes Anglicus de Montepessulano}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Quadrans vetus}}\plain \f0\fs22 ]. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Geometrie due sunt par\-tes theorica et practica. Theorica est, que sola mentis speculatione quantitates proporciones et earum mensuras intuetur}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ... \endash  ... et productum dabit capacitatem. Et sic est finis huius\plain \f0\fs22 . Mit Feder\-zeichnung eines Quadrans vetus (56\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22  am Rand) und 16 geometrischen Figuren. Ed.: Paul Tannery: Le trait\u233 \'e9 du quadrant de ma\u238 \'eetre Robert Angl\u232 \'e8s (Montpellier, XIII\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 e\plain \f0\fs22  si\u232 \'e8cle), texte latin et ancienne traduction grecque. In: Notices et extraits des manuscrits de la Biblioth\u232 \'e8que nationale 35,2 (1897), S. 593\endash 632; Nan L. Hahn: Medieval Mensuration: \u8218 \'82Quadrans vetus\lquote  and \u8218 \'82Geometrie Due Sunt Partes Principales ...\lquote . Philadelphia 1982 (Transactions of the American Philo\-sophical Society 72,8), S. 6\endash 113. Zu Verfasser, Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. ebd., S. XV\endash XXIII;  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Thorndike/Kibre, Catalogue of Incipits, 1963}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Sp. 585. (58\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 ) am Rand Versus et Notae de regulis proportionum. Im Anschluss drei Regeln zur H\u246 \'f6hen- und Entfernungsberechnung\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f0\fs22 sowie [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[2].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Pseudo-Messahalah}}\plain \f0\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 De practica astrolabii}}\plain \f0\fs22 ], Exzerpt (Anfang). {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Nomina instrumentorum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ... \endash  ... stellarum in nocte\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (s. o. 37\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 )\plain \f0\fs22 . Ed.: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Gunther, Science 5, 1929}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 217f.}

