\pard\fi0\li0\tx285\tx720\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 66\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 -70\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22  [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Prosdocimus de Beldemandis}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 :] {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Compositio astrolabii secundum novam et veterem compositionem}}\plain \f0\fs22 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Quamvis de astrolabii composicione tam modernorum quam veterum dicta habeantur pulcherrima}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 \u8249 \'8b ... \~\endash  ... exempla possunt clarius patere in figura depicta. Et in hoc terminatur Compositio astrolabii, de quo Deus sit benedictus. Amen.\plain \f0\fs22  Zu Verfasser, Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Thorndike/Kibre, Catalogue of Incipits, 1963}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Sp.\~1164; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Rosi\u324 nska, Instrumenty, 1974}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 105 (Nr. 11); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Rosi\u324 nska, Writings, 1984}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 336f. (Nr. 1715); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[3].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Kunitzsch, Glossar, 1982}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 505 (Anm. 84); Mieczys\u322 law Markowski: Astronomica et astrologica Cracoviensia ante annum 1550. Firenze 1990 (Istituto Nazionale di Studi sul Rinascimento. Studi e testi 20), S. 188 (Nr. 107). Am Rand (67\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 rv\plain \f0\fs22 ) Nachtrag von Ludolphus de Borchtorpe: [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Henricus Bate}}\plain \f0\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Magistralis compositio astrolabii}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Exzerpt (Gradangaben f\u252 \'fcr Braunschweig) . Ed.: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[4].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Gunther, Astrolabes, 1976}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Bd. 2, S.\~368b\endash 369b)]. (70\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ) Nachtrag: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 De horis inequalibus\plain \f0\fs22 . Ed.: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[5].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Rosi\u324 nska, Instrumenty, 1974}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 143. Zu Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[6].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Thorndike/Kibre, Catalogue of Incipits, 1963}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Sp.\~33; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[7].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Rosi\u324 nska, Writings, 1984}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 20f. (Nr. 22).}

