\pard\fi0\li0\tx285\tx720\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 70\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 \endash 71\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22  [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Johannes Eligerus de Gondersleven}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 ]: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 De compositione quadrantis novi}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Exzerpt mit Erg\u228 \'e4nzungen (aus den {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Canones seu Practica quadrantis}}\plain \f0\fs22 ). {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Com\-po\-si\-turus novum quadrantem accipe tabulam planam ad similitudinem quarte partis circuli}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ... \endash  ... et similiter unum tantum distet a lateribus sicud aliud\plain \f0\fs22 . Zu Verfasser, Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Thorndike/Kibre, Catalogue of Incipits, 1963}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Sp. 241; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Rosi\u324 nska, Instrumenty, 1974}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 109; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Rosi\u324 nska, Writings, 1984}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 84 (Nr.\~368; Profatius Judaeus). Erg\u228 \'e4nzung: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Nomina quadrantis sunt hec: In centro, in quo est clavis cum filo}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ... \endash  ... ad cognoscendum predictam de dorso. Et sic finitur Compositio quadrantis novi\plain \f0\fs22 . Zum Werk vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[3].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Poulle, Quadrant, 1964}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S.\~240. Am Rand Federzeichnung eines Qua\-drans novus (71\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 ) sowie Exzerpte aus [Prophatius Judaeus: Quadrans novus], lat. Version von 1301 (cap. 10; 12\endash 17; Ed: Giuseppe Boffito / C. Melzi d'Eril (Hgg.): Il quadrante d\lquote Israele di Jacob ben Machir ben Tibbon (Profacio). Firenze 1922 (Il facsimile 1), S. 30\endash 37; auch zum folgenden Text, s.\~u.).}

