\pard\fi0\li0\tx285\tx720\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 71\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 \endash 73\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22  [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Johannes Eligerus de Gondersleven}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 ]: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 De utilitate novi quadrantis}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Exzerpt mit Erg\u228 \'e4nzungen. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Utilitates novi quadrantis breviter et lucide colligere visum est mihi utile}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ... \plain \f0\fs22 (71\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 \endash 72\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 ) Eingeschobene Erg\u228 \'e4nzungen aus den 'Canones seu Practica quadrantis': {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Signum et gradus in quo est sol}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ... \endash  ... aries libra elevantur in spera \plain \f0\fs22 (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 recta cum gradibus 55 minutis 46 et tunc \plain \f0\fs22 (korrigiert \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 cum) eodemmodo tot signa simul iuncta\plain \f0\fs22  (?)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  elevationem\plain \f0\fs22  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 in spera \plain \f0\fs22 (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 obliqua\plain \f0\fs22 . Zum Werk vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Poulle, Quadrant, 1964}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S.\~240. (72\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 ) Fortsetzung:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Si vis altitudinem solis vel alicuius stelle scire ... \endash  ... hos igitur require supra in canonibus quadrantis antiqui.\plain \f0\fs22  Am Schlu\u223 \'df fremder Einschub. Zu Verfasser, Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Thorndike/Kibre, Catalogue of Incipits, 1963}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Sp. 1627; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[3].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Rosi\u324 nska, Instru\-menty, 1974}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 112f.; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[4].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Rosi\u324 nska, Writings, 1984}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 445f. (Nr. 2322).}

