\pard\fi0\li0\tx285\tx720\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 81\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 va\plain \f0\fs22 \endash 82\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22  [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Franco de Polonia}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Modus construendi] torquetum}}\plain \f0\fs22 . Titel im Inhaltsverzeichnis (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Canones et nomina turketi \plain \f0\fs22 (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 et parcium eius.\plain \f0\fs22  \u220 \'dcberschrift: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 De turketo \plain \f0\fs22 (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 quod latine dicitur torquetus facto anno Christi 1284\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs28 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  et invento in regia urbe Pragensi\plain \f0\fs22 . Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 De nominibus instrumenti, quod turketus }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 (!)}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17  dicitur, et primo de eius partibus et composicione, postea de eius utilitatibus est dicendum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ... \endash  ... et plura alia sagax lector per se inveniet ex predictis. Et sic est finis huius. Deo gracias.\plain \f0\fs22  Die letzten Zeilen von Ludolphus de Borchtorpe erg\u228 \'e4nzt. Ed: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Gunther, Science 2, 1923}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 370\endash 375. Zu Verfasser, Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Thorndike/Kibre, Catalogue of Incipits, 1963}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Sp. 38; Aleksander Birkenmajer: \u201 \'c9tudes d\lquote histoire des sciences en Pologne. Wroc\u322 law u. a. 1972 (Studia Copernicana 4), S. 444\endash 448, v. a. S. 446 (Anm. 23); Emmanuel Poulle: Bernard de Verdun et le turquet. In: Isis 55 (1964), S. 200\endash 208. (81\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 va\plain \f0\fs22 ) am Rand kleine Federzeichnung eines Torquetum, vgl. dazu Guy Beaujouan / Emmanuel Poulle. In: Le navire et l\lquote \u233 \'e9conomie maritime du XV\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 e\plain \f0\fs22  au XVIII\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 e\plain \f0\fs22  si\u232 \'e8cles. Travaux du Colloque d\lquote histoire maritime tenu, le 17 mai 1956, \u224 \'e0 l'Acad\u233 \'e9mie de Marine. Paris 1957, S. 103\endash 116 (Pl. XIV).}

