\pard\fi0\li0\tx285\tx720\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 94\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 \endash 94\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 rb\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Tractatus de latitudinibus planetarum}}\plain \f0\fs22 . Titel im Inhaltsverzeichnis (1\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 \u8250 \'9bDe latitu\-di\-nibus planetarum\u8249 \'8b. \plain \f0\fs22 Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Latitudo planete nichil aliud est quam distancia ipsius ab ecliptica sive a via solis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ... \endash  ... secundum ymaginacionem statue prius intellecte. Et hec de latitudinibus planetarum dicta sufficiant.}

