\pard\fi0\li0\tx285\tx720\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 94\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 va\plain \f0\fs22 \endash 101\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Hermannus [Zoestius de Marienfeld}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 ]: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Phaselexis [sive De calendarii emendatione}}\plain \f0\fs22 ]. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Gaude et letare sacrosancta Basiliensis sinode preclarissima}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ...\plain \f0\fs22  (94\plain \f0\super\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Incipit prologus: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Veneranda est astronomie scientia}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ...\plain \f0\fs22  (95\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 ) Kapitelverzeichnis. Danach Titel: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Incipit Phazelexis. Capitulum primum. \plain \f0\fs22 Text:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Bene cuncta regens et disponens}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ... \endash  ... et non improperat Jacobi primi cui laus ... Amen. Explicit Phazelexis\plain \f0\fs22  (gestrichen \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 die beate Agnetis 1443\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs28 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 ) Basilee editus anno Christi M CCCC\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs28 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  XXXVII 1437\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs28 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 , copiatus autem in Brunswik 1458\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs28 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  currente in vigilia corporis Christi.\plain \f0\fs22  Ed. (Prolog): Wilhelm Wattenbach: \u220 \'dcber Hermann von Marienfeld aus M\u252 \'fcnster. In: Sitzungsber. d. K\u246 \'f6nigl. Preu\u223 \'df. Akad. d. Wiss. zu Berlin, Jg. 1884. Berlin 1884, S. 107f. (Hs genannt). Zu Verfasser, Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Thorndike/Kibre, Catalogue of Incipits, 1963}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Sp. 579; 1682; 175. Im Anschluss sechs Verse: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Herman }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 (!) }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 conflavit opus hoc}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ...\plain \f0\fs22 , vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Walther, Initia, 1969}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Nr. 7727. Danach (101\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 \endash 101\plain \f0\super\fs28 va\plain \f0\fs22 ) angeh\u228 \'e4ngt: Forma decreti Basiliensis synodi super correctione kalendarii (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Sacrosancta generalis sinodus Basiliensis ... {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Saluberrimas ordinaciones quas patres nostri multo studio}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ... \plain \f0\fs22 2. Sept. 1437) sowie Ausz\u252 \'fcge aus den Basler Konzilsprotokollen zur Kalenderreform (4. Sept. 1437; 8. April 1435; 6. Sept. 1437). Ed.: Wattenbach (s. o.), S. 108f. (Hs genannt). Zu Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Thorndike/Kibre, Catalogue of Incipits, 1963}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Sp. 1367; Ferdinand Kaltenbrunner: Die Vorgeschichte der Gregorianischen Kalenderreform. In: Sitzungsber. d. kaiserl. Akad. d. Wiss. zu Wien, phil.hist. Kl. 82,3. Wien 1876, S. 412\endash 414.}

