\pard\fi0\li0\tx285\tx720\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 101\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22 \endash 108\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Hermannus [Zoestius de Marienfeld}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 ]: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Declaratio kalendarii hebraici}}\plain \f0\fs22 . Prolog: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Vidi in dextera sedentis ... }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 (Apc 5,1)}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 . Illa gloriosa et prepotens regina}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ... \plain \f0\fs22 Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Nunc sequitur Kalendarium hebraicum.\plain \f0\fs22  (102\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Lunacio Aprilis. Primus mensis pasche cerimoniis sacratus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ... \endash   ... verum motum et veram communionem advertere potuerunt. Et in hoc terminatur Declaracio huius kalendarii, quod completum est et editum anno gracie 1436\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs28 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  in Basilea tempore concilii generalis. \plain \f0\fs22 Danach vier Verse: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Edidit Hermannus opus hoc vi pneumatis almi}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ... perhennia regna.\plain \f0\fs22  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 \u8250 \'9bSed cum consilium Basilense non habuit progressum ideoque hec materia huius tractatus mansit non confirmata et ecclesia mansit in pristinis erroribus\u8249 \'8b.\plain \f0\fs22  Am Rand die zugeh\u246 \'f6rigen kurzen Quaestionen, Dubitationen und Notanda. Zu Verfasser, Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Thorndike/Kibre, Catalogue of Incipits, 1963}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Sp. 1696; Wattenbach, Hermann von Marienfeld (s. o.), S. 98 (Hs genannt); S. 100. Eingeschoben zwei Nachtr\u228 \'e4ge von Ludolphus de Borchtorpe: (104\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ) Tabelle zur kirchlichen und astronomischen Osterfestberechnung f\u252 \'fcr 1477\endash 1531\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 .\plain \f0\fs22  (106\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ) Tabula quantitatis dierum artificialium. Druckabschriften aus Johannes Regiomontanus: Calendarium (N\u252 \'fcrnberg, ca. 1474: Hain 13775, 25\plain \f0\super\fs28 rv\plain \f0\fs22 . 28\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 . 32\plain \f0\super\fs28 rv\plain \f0\fs22 ).}

