\pard\fi0\li0\tx285\tx720\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 113\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 \endash 113\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Abraham Judaeus}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 [}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Liber de mundo vel saeculo]}}\plain \f0\fs22 , lat. von {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Henricus Bate}}\plain \f0\fs22 . Titel im Inhaltsverzeichnis (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ) genannt. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Extracta quedam de libro revolu\-ci\-onum Abrahe Judei.\plain \f0\fs22  Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Ex libro revolucionum Abrahe habetur, quod non est scandum scriptis Albumasaris}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ... \endash  ... ut habeatur forcius testimonium. Et hec sufficiant pro nunc. Ad laudem Jhesu. Amen.\plain \f0\fs22  Zu Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. Lynn Thorndike: The Latin Translations of the Astrological Tracts of Abraham Avenezra. In: Isis 35 (1944), S. 294f.; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Glorieux, Facult\u233 \'e9, 1971}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 181 (Nr. 182e). Der letzte Absatz (De pluviis) aus anderer Vorlage.}

