\pard\fi0\li0\tx285\tx720\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 114\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 \endash 121\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 rb\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Johannes Danck de Saxonia}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Canones Tabularum Alphonsinarum}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 .\plain \f0\fs22  Mit Zusatz (De eclipsis). Titel im Inhaltsverzeichnis (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ) genannt: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Canones Tabularum Alphonsii Johannis Danekow de Magde\-borch\plain \f0\fs22 . Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 \u8250 \'9bIncipiunt Canones pro tabulis Alphoncii regis Castelle\u8249 \'8b. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Tempus est numerus vel mensura motus, ut dicit Aristoteles quarto Phisicorum. Cum igitur motum scire desideramus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ... \endash  ... in principio, medio et fine eclipsis, figuram autem facies secundum doctrinam magistri Johannis de Lineriis expressam. Amen. In hoc terminantur Canones circa tabulas regis Alphoncii, pro quo sint grates Deo Christo. Istos canones composuit magister Johannes de Saxonia alio nomine magister Johannes Danekow de Magdeborch\plain \f0\fs22 . Ed.: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Poulle, Tables, 1984}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 30\endash 104. Zu Verfasser, Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Thorndike/Kibre, Catalogue of Incipits, 1963}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Sp. 1560f.; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Rosi\u324 nska, Writings, 1984}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S.\~425f. (Nr. 2227). Zu den angeschlossenen Canones vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[3].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Thorndike/Kibre, Catalogue of Incipits, 1963}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Sp. 482f.; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[4].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Rosi\u324 nska, Writings, 1984}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 136f. (Nr. 637; 639); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[5].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Poulle, Tables, 1984}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 24 (Nr. b). 121\plain \f0\super\fs28 rb\plain \f0\fs22 \endash 121\plain \f0\super\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22  Nachtrag: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Henricus Salder}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Notabilia in Tabulas Alphonsi regis}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Auszug. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Notandum pro primo canone, quod (gestrichen ex) hoc nomen era habet duas significationes}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ...\plain \f0\fs22  (dat. 1440).}

