\pard\fi0\li0\tx285\tx720\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 144\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 \endash 154\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22  [\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Pseudo-]{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Guilelmus [Anglicus] Marsiliensis}}\plain \f0\fs22  [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Johannes de Sicilia}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 ]: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Scriptum super Canones Azarchelis [de Tabulis Toletanis}}\plain \f0\fs22 ]. Auszug mit bearbeitenden Einsch\u252 \'fcben. Titel: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Incipiunt Scripta Marsiliensis super canones Azarchelis supra habitos ad folium 39\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs28 m\plain \f0\fs22  (s. o.). Text: Cum cuiuslibet accionis. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Liber iste scilicet Canones tabularum Archazelis duas partes principales continet}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ... \endash  ... primus tamen modus formacionis est universalior et eum Thebit accipit pro radice. Deo gracias. Amen ... Et sic est finis huius lecture finite per me Hinricum Brunswik in studio Erfordensi pro honorabili viro magistro Ludolfo Borchtorp de Brunswik\plain \f0\fs22  (erg\u228 \'e4nzt von Borchtorpe \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 anno domini 1445 incompleto in die parasceves hora 6\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs28 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  vel quasi ...\plain \f0\fs22 ). Mit Tabelle und zwei geometrischen Zeichnungen. Ed.: Fritz S. Pedersen (Hg.): Scriptum Johannis de Sicilia super canones Azarchelis de tabulis Toletanis. In: Cahiers de l\lquote Institut du Moyen-\u194 \'c2ge grec et latin, Bd. 52 (1986), S. 3\endash 268. Zu Verfasser, Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. ebd., Bd. 51 (1986), S. 12\endash 15; 28f.; 37f.; 41f.; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Thorndike/Kibre, Catalogue of Incipits, 1963}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Sp. 822. (154\plain \f0\super\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22 ) Geographisch-astrologische Nachtr\u228 \'e4ge.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

