\pard\fi0\li0\tx285\tx720\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 158\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 \endash 175\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 rb\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Henricus Salder}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Canones tabularum Alfonsinarum}}\plain \f0\fs22 . Titel im Inhalts\-verzeichnis (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ) genannt: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Canones Hinrici Salder super tabulis Alphoncii peroptime\plain \f0\fs22 . Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 In nomine domini misericordis ... et beati Martini amen. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Licet multi libri sint conscripti, qui canones tabularum appellantur}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  \u8230 \'85 \endash  ... et de erratis petens veniam estimo fore dignum. Expliciunt Canones magistri Hinrici Salderi scripti Erfordie 1443 feria 5\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs28 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ante Invocavit\plain \f0\fs22 . Mit neun Tabellen. Zu Verfasser, Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Thorndike/Kibre, Catalogue of Incipits, 1963}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Sp. 828; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Rosi\u324 nska, Writings, 1984}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 228f. (Nr.\~1145); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Zinner, Verzeichnis, 1925}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Nr. 9599\endash 9604.}

