\pard\fi0\li0\tx285\tx720\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 175\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Johannes de Lineriis}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 [Canones tabularum primi mobilis}}\plain \f0\fs22 ], Ausz\u252 \'fcge (De sinibus, declinacione et umbris). Titel im Inhalts\-verzeichnis (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ) genannt: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Extracta quedam ex Linerio de sinibus, declinacione et umbris\plain \f0\fs22 . Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Notandum pro sinibus, quod duplex est sinus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ... \endash  ... et proveniet arcus quem queris\plain \f0\fs22 . Ed. (teilw.): {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Curtze, Trigonometrie, 1900}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 391\endash 402 (Nr. 1\endash 19). Zu Verfasser, Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Thorndike/Kibre, Catalogue of Incipits, 1963}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Sp. 1509; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Rosi\u324 nska, Writings, 1984}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 410 (Nr.\~2140); 92 (Nr. 413).}

