\pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 175\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 va\plain \f0\fs22 \endash 184\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Alcabitius}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Liber introductorius ad iudicia astrorum}}\plain \f0\fs22 , lateinisch von\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Johannes Hispalensis}}\plain \f0\fs22 . Titel: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Alkabicius me fecit et sic me incipit.\plain \f0\fs22  Prolog: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Postulata a domino prolixitate vite}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ... \plain \f0\fs22 Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 In nomine domini amen. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Sichal }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 (!, f\u252 \'fcr }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Nitach}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 )}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17  id est circulus signorum secundum aliam literam}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ... \endash  ... quin proferamus illud. Perfectus est Introductorius Abdilazysis ... qui dicitur Alkabicius ad magisterium iudiciorum astrorum ... a Iohanne Hispalensi ex arabico in latinum est interpretatus. Amen. 1443 incompleto altero die apostolorum Simonis et Iude de sancta hora 8\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs28 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  completus est Alkabitius Erfordie\plain \f0\fs22 . Zu Verfasser, Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Thorndike/Kibre, Catalogue of Incipits, 1963}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Sp. 1078; 913; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Carmody, Sciences, 1956}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 143\endash 150. Tafeln nachgetragen (261\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22 ).}

