bre, Catalogue of Incipits, 1963}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Sp.\~1411; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Carmody, Sciences, 1956}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 40 (Nr. 3.1). (242\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 \endash 242\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22 ) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[2].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Praecepta sive] Iudicia quinqua\-ginta}}\plain \f0\fs22 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 \u8250 \'9bIncipiunt precipua iudicia et sunt quinquaginta. Primum capitulum. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Scito, quod significatrix id est luna}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ... \endash  ... gravis enim erit illi. Scito hoc totum\plain \f0\fs22 . Zu Verfasser, Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[3].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Thorndike/Kibre, Catalogue of Incipits, 1963}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Sp.\~1411; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[4].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Carmody, Sciences, 1956}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 41 (Nr. 3.2). (242\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22 \endash 252\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 va\plain \f0\fs22 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[3].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 De interrogationibus sive De iudiciis}}\plain \f0\fs22 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Sequitur capitulum primum de iudiciis ab ascendente. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Cum interrogatus fueris de aliqua interrogacione incipies aspicere sicud }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 (!) }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 predixi tibi}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ... \endash  ... destruet omne, quod pertinet ad eandem domum et omnes res eius. Et sic est finis illius 1443.\plain \f0\fs22  Zu Verfasser, Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[5].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Thorndike/Kibre, Catalogue of Incipits, 1963}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Sp. 312; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[6].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Carmody, Sciences, 1956}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 41 (Nr. 3.3).}

