\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28\cf1 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \endash 185\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28\cf1 vd\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Johannes [de Friburgo}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ]: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Summa confessorum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 . Vulgata-Version mit Zus\u228 \'e4tzen aus weiteren Werken des Verfassers. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Nota de operibus. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Nota, quod lector iste ante compilationem huius Summe confexorum }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 (!) }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 fecerat tabulam super Summam Raymundi}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 -1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Libellus quaestionum casualium, Praefatio. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Quoniam dubiorum nova cotidie }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 (!) }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 difficultas emergit casuum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 -156\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Summa confessorum. Prolog: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Saluti animarum et proximorum utilitati}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 -2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Tituli librorum. (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 -158\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Quoniam inter ecclesiastica crimina symoniaca heresis optinet primum locum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ... - ... tam de penitenciis quam de matrimoniis hic conclusit, cui est honor in secula seculorum. Amen. \u8250 \'9bq.xiii\u8249 \'8b.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (158\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 -159\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Paragraphi summae Raimundi\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Paragrafi Sume {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 (!)}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17  fratris Raymundi per numerum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ... - ... istud in Summa notandum.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (159\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 vd\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 -166\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Statuta summae confessorum ex libro Sexto Decretalium addita. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Ne libri, qui de Summa confexorum }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 (!) }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 iam scripti erant}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ... - ... qui legit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 verba complectens contra legem nititur voluntatem. \u8250 \'9bExplicit compediosa \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 collectio quorundam statutorum ex Sexto Decretalium addita ad Summam confexorum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 . Amen. Deo gratias. Amen.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  166\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  leer. (167\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 -185\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 vd\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Tabula in Summam confessorum. Prolog: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[6].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 In hac tabula ubicumque fit simpliciter libri vel questionis aut remissionis assignatio}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 Text:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[7].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Abbas. Utrum unus abbas possit presidere in diversis monasteriis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ... - ... ||\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  Text bricht bei Buchstabe S (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Sponsalia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) wegen Blattverlust (s. o.) ab.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Zu Verfasser, Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. Leonard E. Boyle: The \lquote Summa Confessorum\rquote  of John of Freiburg and the Popularization of the Moral Teaching of St. Thomas and of some of his Contemporaries. In: Armand A. Maurer / \u201 \'c9tienne Gilson u. a. (Hgg.): St. Thomas Aquinas, 1274\endash 1974. Commemorative Studies, Vol. 2. Toronto 1974, S. 245\endash 268; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 VL (2)}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 , Bd. 4, Sp. 605\endash 611; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Kaeppeli, ScriptOP, 1970}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 , Nr. 2343\endash 2345 (Lit.).}

