\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 1\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -8\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Ordo in electione Romani regis}}\plain \f0\fs22 . Mit Exzerpten aus \plain \f0\scaps\fs22 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Carolus IV. Imperator Romanorum}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Bulla aurea}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 ]\plain \f0\fs22  von {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Franciscus Accoltus}}\plain \f0\fs22  (?). Titel: \plain \f0\i\fs22 Rubrica de causa translacionis eleccionis Romani regis et imperatoris a Grecis ad Germanos per Stephanum Papam III. facte. \plain \f0\fs22 Prolog I: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Constat ex cronicis Romanorum pontificum et per glosam in capitulo 'Venerabilem. De eleccione' }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 (X. 1.6.34.)}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17  super verbo 'Transtulit', quod cum ecclesia Romana opprimeretur ab Astulpho rege Longobardorum}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... \plain \f0\fs22 Prolog II: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Ordo, qui sequitur, in eleccione Romanorum regis et in cesarem seu imperatorem postea assumendi}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... per clare memorie Karolum iiii imperatorem ... sub bulla, qui dicitur aurea ... et a quibus, que omnia ex copia dicte bulle excerpsi. Ego F. Aretin. \plain \f0\fs22 [Franciscus Accoltus (?)]\plain \f0\i\fs22 . Rubrica. \plain \f0\fs22 Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Quociens et quantumque casus seu necessitas eleccionis regis Romani in imperatorem promovendi emerserit}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... et doctrina et linguis valeant verisimiliter erudiri.\plain \f0\fs22  Zu Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Heckmann, Goldene Bulle, 2006}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 197f. (Hs genannt). \u220 \'dcberlieferung auch {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Leipzig, UB, Ms. 951}}\plain \f0\fs22 , 158\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -168\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22  (Leipzig, 1449), vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 L UB Kat. 6}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 85. Am Rand Glossen von Rodevo\u223 \'df. Urspr\u252 \'fcnglich folgend auf Berlin, SB, Ms. boruss. fol. 720 (V).}

