\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 1\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -7\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Regulae cancellariae Nicolai V. Papae}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Verk\u252 \'fcrzte Fassung (1-61, 64-95). Prolog: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Sanctissimus in Christo pater et dominus noster Nicolaus Papa quintus. Normam et ordinem gerendis ... anno nativitate domini mccccxlvii}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... \plain \f0\fs22 Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 In primis reservaciones fecit similes illis, que in constitucione felicis recordacionis Benedicti Pape XII}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... sub bulla expediantur. Alias nulla sunt. Lecte fuerunt suprascripte Regule cancellarie in au[diencia] contradictarum die viii Julii Mccccxlvii\u176 \'b0 indictione decima.\plain \f0\fs22  Ed.: Emil von Ottenthal: Regulae cancellariae apostolicae. Die p\u228 \'e4pstlichen Kanzleiregeln von Johannes XXII. bis Nikolaus V. Innsbruck 1988 (ND Aalen 1968), S. 255-268. Am Rand Glossen von Rodevo\u223 \'df. Urspr\u252 \'fcnglich eingeschoben zwischen Berlin, SB, Ms. lat. fol. 297 und Ms. boruss. 720b.}

