\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 83\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -88\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Johannes Andreae}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22  (?)\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Tractatus de interdicto ecclesiastico}}\plain \f0\fs22 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 De modo servandi interdictum memoriale quoddam simplicibus colligendo sciendum, quod quicumque universitas, civitas vel terra}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... ex contemptu leve peccatum veniat in mortale. >Explicit Tractatus de interdicto ecclesiastico domini Johannis Andree<.\plain \f0\fs22  Zu Verfasser, Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Schulte, Geschichte, 1875}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Bd. 2, S. 223 (Nr. 12a); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 B SB Kat. 4.4}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 133 (Lit.).}

