\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 88\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -89\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22  \plain \f0\scaps\fs22 [Pseudo-?]{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Johannes Andreae}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Distinctio de irregularitate ex violatione censurae ecclesiasticae}}\plain \f0\fs22 . Nachtrag von Rodevo\u223 \'df. \plain \f0\i\fs22 >Distinctio Johannis Andree de irregularitate<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Nota quando et qualiter quis ex violacione censure ecclesiastice incurrat irregularitatem}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... dic ut ibi plene notatur in iuribus preallegatis.\plain \f0\fs22  \u220 \'dcberlieferung auch {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Hildesheim, DomB, Hs 718}}\plain \f0\fs22 , 211\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 -212\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22  (mit vorausgehendem, hier Johannes Andreae zugeschriebenem 'Tractatus de interdicto'), vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 HI DomB Nieders. Kat. 9}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 16; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[1].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Berlin, SB, Ms. Magdeb. 43 (Moskau, NB, Fonds 183, Nr. 2980)}}\plain \f0\fs22 , 195\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 -196\plain \f0\super\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22  (Leipzig, 2. V. 15. Jh.; zwei Texte vorher der anonym \u252 \'fcberlieferte 'Tractatus de interdicto'), vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 B SB Kat. 4.4}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 133.}

