\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 89\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 -90\plain \f0\super\fs28 rb\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Casus episcopales et papales de poenitentia}}\plain \f0\fs22 . Nachtrag von Rodevo\u223 \'df. \plain \f0\i\fs22 >Casus episcopales<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Sciendum est breviter, pro quibus culpis sive casibus ac penis sit ad episcopum penitens remittendus}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... \plain \f0\fs22 (90\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 )\plain \f0\i\fs22  Sequuntur Casus in quibus solus Romanus pontifex absolvit. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Primus est, qui verberat clericum. Hic tamen casus multas habet exceptiones}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... hodie remittitur ad episcopum, a quo potest absolvi per Extravagantes Johannes XXII., que incipiunt 'Consultacioni'. Expliciunt Casus papales anno domini M\u176 \'b0 cccc\u176 \'b0 l\u176 \'b0 in die sanctorum Marci et Marcellani \plain \f0\fs22 [18. Juni 1450] \plain \f0\i\fs22 in Lipczk in bursa aula nuncupata.\plain \f0\fs22  Zu Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Schulte, Geschichte, 1875}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 518; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Bloomfield/Guyot, Incipits, 1979}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Nr. 5298. 90\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22  leer. Handwechsel.}

