\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22\cf1 91\plain \f0\super\fs28\cf1 ra\plain \f0\fs22\cf1 -101\plain \f0\super\fs28\cf1 rb\plain \f0\fs22\cf1  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Registrum Decreti [Gratiani secundum alphabetum}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22\cf1 ]\plain \f0\fs22\cf1 . \plain \f0\i\fs22\cf1 >Registrum Decreti<. \plain \f0\fs22\cf1 Prolog: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Loca decretorum scripsi pro rudibus et provectis multiplici cura fatigatis, ut proposito suo conveniencia possint invenire}}\plain \f0\i\fs22\cf1  ... \plain \f0\fs22\cf1 Text: \plain \f0\i\fs22\cf1 >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Amare Deum<. Augustinus in libro confessionum: Minus Deum amat}}\plain \f0\i\fs22\cf1  ... - ... >Zacheus< ... xxvi q. vii >'Affectum' \plain \f0\fs22\cf1 (C. 26.7.10)\plain \f0\i\fs22\cf1 . Benedictus Deus<.\plain \f0\fs22\cf1  101\plain \f0\super\fs28\cf1 rc\plain \f0\fs22\cf1  leer. Handwechsel. 101\plain \f0\super\fs28\cf1 v\plain \f0\fs22\cf1  Nachtrag einer Urkunde (Wilhelmus de Goch, Dekan und Richter der Di\u246 \'f6zese Naumburg, \u252 \'fcber Streitigkeiten des Havelberger Domherren Henning Schulten w\u228 \'e4hrend dessen Studium in Leipzig, 1420. Ed.: Adolf Friedrich Riedel: Codex diplomaticus Brandenburgensis, Bd. 1. Berlin 1838, S. 43 (Hs genannt)). Danach urspr\u252 \'fcnglich eingeschoben Berlin, SB, Ms. boruss. fol. 720 (I). Handwechsel.}

