\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 112\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -116\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22  \plain \f0\scaps\fs22 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Burchardus de Mansfeld}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22  (?):] [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Quaestiones] de contractibus emptionis et venditionis}}\plain \f0\fs22 . \plain \f0\i\fs22 >Incipit Tractatus de contractibus empcionis et venditionis et redepcionis etc.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Utrum recipere aliquid ultra sortem in mutuo dato semper sit peccatum mortale. Et videtur, quod sic}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... perdere propter culpam vel causam vel propter persuadere contrarium. \plain \f0\fs22 Zu Verfasser, Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 EI UB Kat. 1,2}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 310. Am Rand vereinzelt Glossen und Nachtr\u228 \'e4ge von Rodevo\u223 \'df.}

