\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 117\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -126\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Federicus [Petruccius] de Senis}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22  [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Pseudo-Bartolus de Saxoferrato}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 ]\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Tractatus de permutatione beneficiorum}}\plain \f0\fs22 . Sammlung von 40 Qu\u228 \'e4stionen. \plain \f0\i\fs22 Tractatus de permutacione beneficorum Bartholi de Saxoferrato\plain \f0\fs22  (!)\plain \f0\i\fs22 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Quia circa permutacionum materiam beneficiorum plurimum dubia occurrunt super quibus appeto veritatem declarari, ideo ipsa dubia per modum questionum formabo}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... et ex hiis que utrobique notantur Lapus de Florencia. Explicit Tractatus domini Frederici de Senis super permutacione directus domino Lapo de Podiobonczi, qui fecit addiciones, ut patet in fine cuiuslibet questionis. Deo gracias etc.\plain \f0\fs22  Zu Verfasser, Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Casamassima, Codices Bartoli 1, 1971}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 15 (Hs genannt; Lit.); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Schulte, Geschichte, 1875}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Bd. 2, S. 237f. Am Rand Glossen und Nachtr\u228 \'e4ge von Rodevo\u223 \'df. 126\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22  leer.}

