\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 127\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -130\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Bartolus [de Saxoferrato}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 ]: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Tractatus de duobus fratribus}}\plain \f0\fs22 . \plain \f0\i\fs22 Incipit Tractatulus Bartuli \plain \f0\fs22 (!) \plain \f0\i\fs22 de duobus fratribus insimul habitantibus utilissimus etc. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Iste tractatus in duas partes principales dividitur. Nam quandoque inter eos contenditur de hiis, que in vita patri contingunt}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... in dicta lege 'Si pater de donationibus'\plain \f0\fs22  (D. 39.5.34)\plain \f0\i\fs22 . Finis adest anno domini Mccccxlix in Liptzk in vigilia Palmarum\plain \f0\fs22  [5. April 1449]\plain \f0\i\fs22 .\plain \f0\fs22  Zu Verfasser, Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Casamassima, Codices Bartoli 1, 1971}}\plain \f0\fs22\cf1 , S. 15 (Hs genannt; Lit.); \plain \f0\fs22 Josephus Lodewyk Johannes \plain \f0\fs22\cf1 van de Kamp: Bartolus de Saxoferrato 1313-1357. Leven, werken, invloed, beteekenis. Amsterdam 1936, S. 70f. (Hs auf S. 71 (Anm. 3) genannt). \plain \f0\fs22 \u220 \'dcberlieferung auch {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Leipzig, UB, Ms. 951}}\plain \f0\fs22 , 168\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 -175\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22  (Leipzig, 1449), vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 L UB Kat. 6}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 85. }

