\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 130\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 -134\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Bartolus [de Saxoferrato}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 ]: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Tractatus de insigniis et armis}}\plain \f0\fs22 . \plain \f0\i\fs22 >Tractatus de armis domini Bartoli de Saxoferrato sequitur nunc<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Eorum gracia de insigniis et armis, que quis portat in clippeis, videamus. Primo an hoc sit licitum}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... vel pingere in rubro et nigro. Hunc Tractatulum de insigniis et armis composuit egregius doctor legum dominus Bartholus de Saxoferrato civis Perusinus, qui post mortem eius inventus est et videtur nondum completus. Scriptus Liptzk anno domini Mccccxlix feria ii ante Pasce\plain \f0\fs22  [11. April 1449]\plain \f0\i\fs22 .\plain \f0\fs22  Zu Verfasser, Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Casamassima, Codices Bartoli 1, 1971}}\plain \f0\fs22\cf1 , S. 15 (Hs genannt; Lit.); \plain \f0\fs22 Josephus Lodewyk Johannes \plain \f0\fs22\cf1 van de Kamp: Bartolus de Saxoferrato 1313-1357. Leven, werken, invloed, beteekenis. Amsterdam 1936, S. 67-69 (Hs auf S. 68 (Anm. 4) genannt). \plain \f0\fs22 \u220 \'dcberlieferung auch {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Leipzig, UB, Ms. 951}}\plain \f0\fs22 , 175\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 -182\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22  (Leipzig, 1449; ann\u228 \'e4hernd gleiches Kolophon), vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 L UB Kat. 6}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 85. \plain \f0\fs22\cf1 Am Rand vereinzelt Glossen und Nachtr\u228 \'e4ge von Rodevo\u223 \'df. 134\plain \f0\super\fs28\cf1 v\plain \f0\fs22\cf1  leer.}

