\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 143\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Cinus [de Pistorio]}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Quaestio in lege 'Pactum' (C. 6.20.3)}}\plain \f0\fs22 . \plain \f0\i\fs22 Questionem istam in forma ponit Cynus in lege 'Pactum' Codicis 'In collatio bonorum'\plain \f0\fs22  (C. 6.20.3). {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Pone quidam scolaris habens patrem}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... et ff. 'Ad municipalem' l. 'Lucius' \plain \f0\fs22 (D. 50.1.21)\plain \f0\i\fs22  C. idem respondit.\plain \f0\fs22  Am Rand vereinzelt Glossen von Rodevo\u223 \'df. Danach etwas sp\u228 \'e4terer Einschub von Rodevo\u223 \'df: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6923/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Urkunde}}\plain \f0\fs22  von Bf. Petrus von {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6923/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Naumburg}}\plain \f0\fs22  (reg. 1435-1463, vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Gams, Series episcoporum, 1873}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 296; gleicher Text wie oben 70\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 ).}

