\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22\cf1 147\plain \f0\super\fs28\cf1 r\plain \f0\fs22\cf1 -153\plain \f0\super\fs28\cf1 r\plain \f0\fs22\cf1  \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\cf1 [Pseudo-]{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Matthias D\u246 \'f6ring}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22\cf1  [Pseudo-{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Gregorius heimburg}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22\cf1  (?): {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Confutatio primatus papae}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22\cf1 ]\plain \f0\fs22\cf1 . Nachgetragene Notiz von Rodevo\u223 \'df: \plain \f0\i\fs22\cf1 Sis\plain \f0\fs22\cf1  \plain \f0\i\fs22\cf1 cautus in perlectione huius libelli, quia confectus fuit olim tempore concilii Basiliensis a quodam occulto heretico; continet enim et resuscitare conatur heresim Hussititarum in sacris generalibus Constanciensi et Basiliensi conciliis late reprobatam. Et specialiter per dicti libelli reprobacione invenitur quidam tractatus, qui incipit 'Quesivistis r[everende] p[ater]' \plain \f0\fs22\cf1 [Nikolaus Weigel: Consilium de reprobatione Confutationis primatus papae]\plain \f0\i\fs22\cf1  etc., factus, ut creditur, Erfordie. Alius erat, qui incipit 'Inter ceteras' factus a magistro Mathia Doring ministro etc. in Kiritz. Non videtur cautum simplicibus hos errores videre nisi et dictos tractatulos reprobatorios seu alia in contrarium determinata aliquociens ad oculum habere possint. \plain \f0\fs22\cf1 Text: \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Scienti bonum facere ... {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 (Iac 4,17)}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1  ... Videamus status presentis ecclesie}}\plain \f0\i\fs22\cf1  ... - ... interest rudi stilo, ut melius possint intelligi commemorasse sufficiant \plain \f0\fs22\cf1 (!)\plain \f0\i\fs22\cf1 . Explicit.\plain \f0\fs22\cf1  Am Rand Glossen und Nachtr\u228 \'e4ge von Rodevo\u223 \'df (zwei Schichten). Zu Verfasser, Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. Petra Weigel: Ordensreform und Konziliarismus. Der Franziskanerprovinzial Matthias D\u246 \'f6ring (1427-1461). Frankfurt/Main u. a. 2005 (Jenaer Beitr\u228 \'e4ge zur Geschichte 7), S. 121-147, v.a. S. 144f.; 440 (Nr. 4; anonym; dat. Mitteldeutschland, 1443; Hs genannt); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 VL (2)}}\plain \f0\fs22\cf1 , Bd. 2, S. 207-210 (Hs in Sp. 209 genannt).}

