\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22\cf1 247\plain \f0\super\fs28\cf1 r\plain \f0\fs22\cf1  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Quaestiones [de iure canonico et civili}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22\cf1 ]\plain \f0\fs22\cf1 . Nachtrag von Rodevo\u223 \'df. Sammlung von zwei Qu\u228 \'e4stionen. Nr. 1: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Queritur in quo iudicio seu foro leges sunt servande, respondetur, quod in distinctione, si non habeat canonem, contrarium generatur}}\plain \f0\i\fs22\cf1  ...\plain \f0\fs22\cf1  Nr. 2: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Quid si religiosus legat privatim socio suo vel audiat leges in camera sua, an mereat penam excommunicacionis. Dicit Hostiensis quod sic}}\plain \f0\i\fs22\cf1  ...}

