\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22\cf1 247\plain \f0\super\fs28\cf1 v\plain \f0\fs22\cf1 -250\plain \f0\super\fs28\cf1 v\plain \f0\fs22\cf1  \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\cf1 [Pseudo-{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Sophronius Eusebius] Hieronymus}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22\cf1 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Tractatus de membris et lineamentis Dei}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22\cf1  [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Eucherius Lugdunensis}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22\cf1 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Formularium spiritualis intelligentiae}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22\cf1 , cap. 1 (De divinis nominibus)]\plain \f0\fs22\cf1 . Verk\u252 \'fcrzte Fassung. Nachtrag von Rodevo\u223 \'df. Titel (\u252 \'fcbergeschrieben von Rodevo\u223 \'df): \plain \f0\i\fs22\cf1 Tractatus de membris Dei editus a beato Jeronimo. \plain \f0\fs22\cf1 Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Omnipotens Deus, pater et filius et spiritus sanctus, unus atque trinus, unus scilicet in natura, trinus in personis}}\plain \f0\i\fs22\cf1  ... - ... quia mutavit eius statum eo quod propter peccatum volebat eum delere. Et de Saul primo Regum XV. dominus dixit ad Samuelem: Penitet me, quod constituerim Saul in regem etc\plain \f0\fs22\cf1 . (1 Sm 15,11).\plain \f0\i\fs22\cf1  Explicit Tractatulus de membris Dei et lineamentis per beatum Jeronimum compilatus ad nostrum intellectum.\plain \f0\fs22\cf1  Ed.: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 PL}}\plain \f0\fs22\cf1 , Bd. 50, Sp. 729-736 (Eucherius) = Bd. 42, Sp. 1199-1205 (Ps.-Augustinus). Zu Verfasser, Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Glorieux, Migne, 1952}}\plain \f0\fs22\cf1 , S. 32 (Eucherius); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Stegm\u252 \'fcller RB}}\plain \f0\fs22\cf1 , Nr. 2258 (Eucherius); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[3].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 CPPM}}\plain \f0\fs22\cf1 , Bd. 2A, Nr. 172; 863 (Ps.-Hieronymus; Ps.-Augustinus; Ps.-Ambrosius; Ps.-Bonaventura); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[4].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 CPL}}\plain \f0\fs22\cf1 , Nr. 633 (Hieronymus). Am Rand Glossen von Rodevo\u223 \'df.}

