\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22\cf1 250\plain \f0\super\fs28\cf1 v\plain \f0\fs22\cf1 -252\plain \f0\super\fs28\cf1 v\plain \f0\fs22\cf1  [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Robertus de Bredlintona}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22\cf1  (?): {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Expositio orationis dominicae}}\plain \f0\fs22\cf1 ]. Nachtrag von Rodevo\u223 \'df. \plain \f0\i\fs22\cf1 >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Pater noster<. Unusquisque homo, qui patrat }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 (!),}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1  clamet }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 (!)}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1  in celum}}\plain \f0\i\fs22\cf1  ... - ... Et ponitur tunc verbaliter etc.\plain \f0\fs22\cf1  Zu Verfasser, Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Bloomfield/Guyot, Incipits, 1979}}\plain \f0\fs22\cf1 , Nr. 9226 (Robertus de Bredlintona); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Stegm\u252 \'fcller RB}}\plain \f0\fs22\cf1 , Nr. 5613 (Michael de Bononia; Abweichungen, v.a. am Ende); 7377,3 (Robertus de Bredlintona); 9329 (anyonm; Abweichungen, v.a. am Ende); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Sharpe, Handlist}}\plain \f0\fs22\cf1 , Nr. 1435 (anonym; wohl nicht Robertus de Bredlintona). Am Rand Nota-Zeichen von Rodevo\u223 \'df. Am Ende nachgetragenes {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Paternoster}}\plain \f0\fs22\cf1  und {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[2].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Ave Maria}}\plain \f0\fs22\cf1  (nd.) von Rodevo\u223 \'df. Urspr\u252 \'fcnglich nach drei leeren Seiten (alte Z\u228 \'e4hlfolge; entfernt) folgend Berlin, SB, Ms. boruss. fol. 720 (VII).}

