\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 1\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 -83\plain \f0\super\fs28 rb\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Antonius Andreae}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 : [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Quaestiones] super Metaphysicam Aristotelis}}\plain \f0\fs22 . Mit Nachtrag. Prolog: \plain \f0\i\fs22 >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Girum celi circuivi sola Ecc.< xiiii }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 (Ecl 24,8)}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 . Secundum doctrinam Aristotelis et eum communiter sequencium sciencia metaphysice, que theologia philosophorum et sapientia nominatur}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... \plain \f0\fs22 (1\plain \f0\super\fs28 rb\plain \f0\fs22 ) Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Quia secundum doctrinam Aristotelis primo Posteriorum notitia subiecti supponitur toti sciencie}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - \plain \f0\fs22 (83\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 ) \plain \f0\i\fs22 ... unus ergo princeps tocius universi, qui est Deus benedictus vivens et regnans super universam creaturam a seculo usque in seculum. >Amen<. \plain \f0\fs22 Nachtrag direkt angeschlossen: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Notandum, quod in 13 et 14 libro, qui sequuntur, pertractat philosophus}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - \plain \f0\fs22 (83\plain \f0\super\fs28 rb\plain \f0\fs22 ) \plain \f0\i\fs22 ... revoco paratus libenti animo emendare. Benedictus dominus noster Jhesus Christus. Amen. \plain \f0\fs22 Kolophon (nachgetragen von Schreiberhand):\plain \f0\i\fs22  Explicit Metaphysica fratris Anthonii Andree. Incipit Tabula super eandem Metaphysicam. \plain \f0\fs22 Zu Verfasser, Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Lohr, Commentaries A -F, 1967}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 364f. \u220 \'dcberlieferung auch {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Berlin, SB, Ms. theol. lat. qu. 32}}\plain \f0\fs22 , 48\plain \f0\super\fs28 va\plain \f0\fs22 -146\plain \f0\super\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22  (Erfurt, Franziskaner, 1426; ohne Registrierungsvermerke im Text), vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Rose}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Bd. 2.3, S. 1232\endash 1235 (Nr. 975); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[1].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Stuttgart, LB, HB X 10}}\plain \f0\fs22 , 1\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -115\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22  (Erfurt, Franziskaner, 1480/81), vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[3].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 S LB HB Kat. 4.1}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 69. Am Rand Glossen, Korrekturen und Nachtr\u228 \'e4ge von Schreiberhand (mit Zusatz von Registereintr\u228 \'e4gen) sowie mehrerer zeitgen\u246 \'f6ssische H\u228 \'e4nde, 2. Dr. 15. Jh.}

