\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 83\plain \f0\super\fs28 rb\plain \f0\fs22 -87\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Kilianus Stetzing}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Tabula super Metaphysicam Antonii Andreae}}\plain \f0\fs22 . Autograph; Schriftduktus mehrfach neu ansetzend (auch duplizierte Passage 86\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 ). Bezug auf nachglossierte Registrierungsvermerke im Haupttext (s.o.). {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Abstractio duplex libro 3\u176 \'b0 questione 2a}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... non est necessarium, licet sit possibile, ibidem. \plain \f0\fs22 Textschlu\u223 \'df und Kolophon auf nachtr\u228 \'e4glich zugesetztem Blatt (86\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ) wiederholt. \plain \f0\i\fs22 >Explicit Tabula super Metaphysicam reverendi doctoris fratris Anthonii Andree ordinis minorum Scotelli magno labore collecta et in unum redacta per fratrem K\u253 \'fdl\u253 \'fdanum \plain \f0\fs22 [86\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22  erg\u228 \'e4nzt \plain \f0\i\fs22 Stetzing\plain \f0\fs22 ] \plain \f0\i\fs22 eiusdem ordinis tempore studii sui in Anglia Colcestrie, Erfordie vero conpleta\plain \f0\fs22  (!)\plain \f0\i\fs22 , quibus propicietur Deus<.\plain \f0\fs22  Zu Verfasser, Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Lohr, Commentaries, Johannes de Kanthi - Myngodus, 1971}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 306f.; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 VL (2)}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Bd. 9, Sp. 331f.; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[4].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Meier, Stetzing, 1936}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 195f.; 266. \u220 \'dcberlieferung auch {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Berlin, SB, Ms. theol. lat. qu. 32}}\plain \f0\fs22 , 148\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 -152\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22  (Erfurt, Franziskaner, 1426; anonym), vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Rose}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Bd. 2.3, S. 1232-1235 (Nr. 975); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[1].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Stuttgart, LB, HB X 10}}\plain \f0\fs22 , 116\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -120\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22  (Erfurt, Franziskaner, 1480/81; anonym), vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[3].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 S LB HB Kat. 4.1}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 69. 86\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 . 87\plain \f0\super\fs28 rb\plain \f0\fs22 -87\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22  leer.}

