\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22\cf1 187\plain \f0\super\fs28\cf1 rv\plain \f0\fs22\cf1  [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Andreas Capellanus}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22\cf1 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 De amore}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22\cf1 ]\plain \f0\fs22\cf1 , Auszug (I,6,F: Epistula ad comitissam Campaniae cum Responsione eius). Titel: \plain \f0\i\fs22\cf1 Epistola interrogatoria de Gualthero an amor locum suum inter coniugatos habere possit.\plain \f0\fs22\cf1  Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Illustri femine ac sapienti N. Campanie comitisse, mulier nobilis }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 (eingef\u252 \'fcgt }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 >A.<}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 )}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1  ... Antiqua nobis consuetudo aperto demonstrat}}\plain \f0\i\fs22\cf1  ...   - ... sit veritati constanti. Anno domini etc.\plain \f0\fs22\cf1  Ed.: Emil Trojel (Hg.): Andreae Capellani regii Francorum De amore libri tres. M\u252 \'fcnchen 1972, S. 150-155.}

