\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22\cf1 243\plain \f0\super\fs28\cf1 r\plain \f0\fs22\cf1 -269\plain \f0\super\fs28\cf1 v\plain \f0\fs22\cf1  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat18\cf1 [}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat18\cf1 Pseudo-]Aeneas Silvius [Piccolomini (Pius Papa II.)}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22\cf1 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat18\cf1 Rhetorica ad] Johannem Marchionem de Baden}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22\cf1  =\plain \f0\scaps\fs22\cf1  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat18\cf1 Albrecht von Eyb}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22\cf1 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat18\cf1 [Praecepta artis] rhetoricae}}\plain \f0\fs22\cf1 . \plain \f0\i\fs22\cf1 Enee Senensis Rhetorica \plain \f0\fs22\cf1 (gestrichen \plain \f0\i\fs22\cf1 Poetica\plain \f0\fs22\cf1 )\plain \f0\i\fs22\cf1  Marchioni Johanni de Baden modo \plain \f0\fs22\cf1 (!)\plain \f0\i\fs22\cf1  episcopo Treverensi missa. Incipit feliciter. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat18\cf1 Bene esset, vir illustris, quod quoniam omnis eloquencie et perfecte elocucionis percepcio  ... In iunctura igitur}}\plain \f0\i\fs22\cf1  ... - ... sed iam hiis finem impono. Valebis igitur, princeps illustrissime ... Et Alberthum de Eis \plain \f0\fs22\cf1 (!) [Eyb]\plain \f0\i\fs22\cf1  tui obsequentissimum ... Et per me sic adducta tibi fac sint quam gratissima etc. Enee Silvii poete episcopi Senensis Rhetorica oratoria poetica illustrissimi principi ac domino domino Johanni marchioni de Baden modo \plain \f0\fs22\cf1 (!)\plain \f0\i\fs22\cf1  episcopo Treverensi missa feliciter finit.\plain \f0\fs22\cf1  Zu Verfasser, Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat18\cf1 Bertalot, Initia, 1985}}\plain \f0\fs22\cf1 , Bd. 2, Nr. 9467; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat18\cf1 VL (2)}}\plain \f0\fs22\cf1 , Bd. 1, Sp. 182 (Lit.). \u220 \'dcberlieferung auch {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat18\cf1 T\u252 \'fcbingen, UB, Mc. 70}}\plain \f0\fs22\cf1 , I\plain \f0\super\fs28\cf1 r\plain \f0\fs22\cf1 -29\plain \f0\super\fs28\cf1 r\plain \f0\fs22\cf1  (S\u252 \'fcdwestdeutschland?, nach 1471; enge Abh\u228 \'e4ngigkeit durch Bindefehler), vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[3].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat18\cf1 T\u220 \'dc UB Kat. 1,1}}\plain \f0\fs22\cf1 , S. 189.}

