\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22\cf1 269\plain \f0\super\fs28\cf1 v\plain \f0\fs22\cf1 -272\plain \f0\super\fs28\cf1 r\plain \f0\fs22\cf1  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat18\cf1 Gasparinus [Barzizius}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22\cf1 ]: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat18\cf1 Epilogus de tribus elocutionis [partibus] ac Summa praeceptorum}}\plain \f0\fs22\cf1 . \plain \f0\i\fs22\cf1 Gasperini \plain \f0\fs22\cf1 (!) \plain \f0\i\fs22\cf1 Pergamensis de tribus elocucionis\plain \f0\fs22\cf1  (!) \plain \f0\i\fs22\cf1 Epilogus ac Summa preceptorum. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat18\cf1 Tribus rebus commoda et perfecta elocucio constat}}\plain \f0\i\fs22\cf1  ... - ... et per occupacionem fiat etc.\plain \f0\fs22\cf1  Ed.: Robert P. Sonkowsky: A fifteenth-century rhetorical opusculum. In: Charles Henderson (Hg.): Classical, medieval and Renaissance studies in honor of Berthold Louis Ullman, Bd. 2. Roma 1964 (Storia e letteratura 94), S. 259-281, hier: S. 268-276.\plain \f0\fs16  \plain \f0\fs22\cf1 Zu Verfasser, Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. ebd., S. 259-280; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat18\cf1 Bertalot, Initia, 1985}}\plain \f0\fs22\cf1 , Bd. 2, Nr. 23117 (Lit.). 272\plain \f0\super\fs28\cf1 v\plain \f0\fs22\cf1 -273\plain \f0\super\fs28\cf1 r\plain \f0\fs22\cf1  leer. Handwechsel.}

