\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 (V-1)\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 9\plain \f0\fs22  + 21 V\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 219\plain \f0\fs22  + III\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 225\plain \f0\fs22  + V\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 235\plain \f0\fs22  + (V-2)\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 243\plain \f0\fs22\cf1 ; Reklamanten (I-III \u252 \'fcbergreifend; mit Zierrahmen, d. h. italienischer Typus); Lagensignaturen (I-III \u252 \'fcbergreifend, Bll. 90-129 gest\u246 \'f6rt); 109\plain \f0\super\fs28\cf1 v\plain \f0\fs22\cf1  Pecienvermerk, Humanistica, um 1400: \plain \f0\i\fs22\cf1 [...] litterat.\plain \f0\fs22\cf1  (?)\plain \f0\i\fs22\cf1  xxviiii petie cholorie \plain \f0\fs22\cf1 (!) \plain \f0\i\fs22\cf1 litterat.\plain \f0\fs22\cf1  (?)\plain \f0\i\fs22\cf1  x octo \plain \f0\fs22\cf1 (?) \plain \f0\i\fs22\cf1 Stefanus [...]\plain \f0\fs22\cf1 ; Bl. 1 entfernt (Textverlust); Blattweiser (ausgerissen) \u183 \'b7 2 Sp. \u183 \'b7 Schriftraum \plain \f0\fs22 28,5\plain \f0\fs22\cf1  \u215 \'d7 \plain \f0\fs22 18,5 (I-II); 30,5\plain \f0\fs22\cf1  \u215 \'d7 \plain \f0\fs22 18 (III); 30,5\plain \f0\fs22\cf1  \u215 \'d7 \plain \f0\fs22 19 (IV)\plain \f0\fs22\cf1  \u183 \'b7 \plain \f0\fs22 55-70 Z. (I-III); 50-60 Z. (IV) \plain \f0\fs22\cf1 \u183 \'b7 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5704[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Hybrida}}\plain \f0\fs22\cf1  und {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5704[1]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Rotunda}}\plain \f0\fs22\cf1 , drei H\u228 \'e4nde (Johannes Ghiselins, Lambertus de Arnem u.a.) \u183 \'b7 Rote und blaue Rubrizierung; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5270[1]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Lombarden zumeist mit Fleuronn\u233 \'e9e}}\plain \f0\fs22\cf1  (I-III; Nordostitalien) \u183 \'b7 F\u252 \'fcnf mehrfarbige, teilweise (II-III) auch goldene {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5270[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Feldinitialen mit Fleuronn\u233 \'e9e}}\plain \f0\fs22\cf1  (\plain \f0\fs22 23\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 . 37\plain \f0\super\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22 . 49\plain \f0\super\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22 . 70\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 . 110\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 ; Bologna, um 1400, vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 M SB Illum. 6.2}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Nr. 35; Massimo Medica: Haec sunt statuta. Le corporazioni medievali nelle miniature bolognesi. Mostra, Rocca di Vignola, 27 marzo - 11 luglio 1999. Modena 1999, S. 71 (Nr. 18); Thomas Kren / Kurt Barstow: Italian Illuminated Manuscripts in the Paul Getty Museum. 2. Ed. Los Angeles 2015, S. 28-33)}

