\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 226\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 -242\plain \f0\super\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Bartolus de Saxoferrato}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 : [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Tractatus super constitutione 'Ad reprimendum' sive] Leges super crimine laesae maiestatis Henrici VII.}}\plain \f0\fs22  Titel: \plain \f0\i\fs22 >Quomodo in lesse \plain \f0\fs22 (!) \plain \f0\i\fs22 maiestatis crimine procedatur. Rubrica. Rubrica. Rubrica<. \plain \f0\fs22 Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Henricus septimus divina favente ... Ad reprimendum multorum facinora corruptis tocius debite}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... et istud data est comune \plain \f0\fs22 (!) \plain \f0\i\fs22 ad hanc constitucionem et procedentem. Bartolus de Saxoferato \plain \f0\fs22 (!) \plain \f0\i\fs22 legum doctor. Expliciunt leges super crimine lese maiestatis composite per serenissimum principem Enrici \plain \f0\fs22 (!) \plain \f0\i\fs22 Romanorum imperatorem et comentate \plain \f0\fs22 (!) \plain \f0\i\fs22 per excellentissimum legum doctorem dominum Bartholum de Saxoferrato. Deo gracias. Amen.\plain \f0\fs22  Zu Verfasser und Werk vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Casamassima, Codices Bartoli 1, 1971}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 20f. Am Rand vereinzelt Glossen und Nachtr\u228 \'e4ge von Schreiberhand sowie einer weiteren Hand, Humanistica, 15. Jh. (gleiche Glossenhand wie Teil III, s.o.).}

