\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 3\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 -66\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat18 Rhazes}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat18 Liber [medicinalis ad] Almansorem}}\plain \f0\fs22 , lat. von {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat18 Gerardus Cremonensis}}\plain \f0\fs22 . Titel (Nachtrag der Glossenhand, 1. H. 15. Jh.): \plain \f0\i\fs22 Abubecri Azari filii Zacharie, qui ab eo vocatus est Almansor eo quod regis Mansoris Ysaac filii precepto editus est. \plain \f0\fs22 Titel (Schreiberhand): \plain \f0\i\fs22 >Incipit liber Albubecri \plain \f0\fs22 (!) \plain \f0\i\fs22 Rasis filii Zacharie translato \plain \f0\fs22 (!) \plain \f0\i\fs22 a magistro Gerhardo Remonensi \plain \f0\fs22 (!) \plain \f0\i\fs22 de arabico in latinum, qui ab eo Almosorius \plain \f0\fs22 (!) \plain \f0\i\fs22 vocatur eo quod, ut regis Mansoris Ysaac filii precepto editus sit verbi Albubecri<.\plain \f0\fs22  Prolog: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat18 In hoc libro aggregabo}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ...\plain \f0\fs22  (3\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 -4\plain \f0\super\fs28 vd\plain \f0\fs22 ) Inhaltsverzeichnis. (4\plain \f0\super\fs28 vc\plain \f0\fs22 ) Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat18 Creator omni Deus ossa condidit regi, cuius vitam prolonget Deus}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... et in panno ligata in sirupo ponantur. >Explicit Liber Almasorius<. \plain \f0\fs22 Kolophon (Glossenhand, 1. H. 15. Jh.): \plain \f0\i\fs22 Et postquam complevimus convenienter omnes et capittula \plain \f0\fs22 (!), \plain \f0\i\fs22 quapropter Deo eius auxilio hoc ad finem perduximus gracie sint infinite. Explicit Liber Almansoris cuius omnia capitula sunt 400 et 18.\plain \f0\fs22  Zu Verfasser, Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat18 Thorndike/Kibre, Catalogue of Incipits, 1963}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Sp. 677; 679 (Prolog); 272 (Text). Am Rand sowie im Text zahlreiche Glossen, Korrekturen und Nachtr\u228 \'e4ge von Schreiberhand und weiteren H\u228 \'e4nden, E. 13. und 1. H. 15. Jh.}

