\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 2\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 -51\plain \f0\super\fs28 rb\plain \f0\fs22  \plain \f0\scaps\fs22 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Bernardus Papiensis}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 :] {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Summa [compilationis primae] Decretalium [cum casibus eiusdem]}}\plain \f0\fs22 . Mit titelweiser Zuordnung der Casus. Titel: \plain \f0\i\fs22 >Incipit Summa Decretalium<.\plain \f0\fs22  Prolog: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Gloria patris }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 (!) }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 filius sapiens, profectus discipuli}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ...\plain \f0\fs22  Text (Casus): {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Flores apparuerunt in terra nostra}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ...\plain \f0\fs22  Text (Summa): {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Auxiliante domino de constitutionibus ecclesiasticis tractaturi}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... gratias indefinenter agamus. \plain \f0\fs22 Danach Versus: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Flavia cepit opus confirmavitque Papia / }}\plain \f0\i\fs22 Contulit auxilium de celo summa sophia / Corrigat hec dicta nec fit dilectio ficta / Ob tres res gestas tibi gloria trina potestas.\plain \f0\fs22  Ed.: Ernst Adolph Theodor Laspeyres (Hg.): Bernardi Papiensis episcopi Summa decretalium\plain \f0\fs16 . \plain \f0\fs22 Regensburg 1860 (ND Graz 1956), S. 1-283 (Summa); 327-352 (Casus). Zu Verfasser, Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Kuttner, Repertorium, 1937}}\plain \f0\fs22\cf1 , S. 387-390 (Summa, dat. 1191/98; Hs genannt); 398f. (Casus, dat. 1198/1213; Hs genannt); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Schulte, Geschichte, 1875}}\plain \f0\fs22\cf1 , Bd. 1, S. 175-182, v.a. S. 180-182 (Hs genannt). Am Rand einmal (20\plain \f0\super\fs28\cf1 ra\plain \f0\fs22\cf1 ) Glosse (\plain \f0\i\fs22\cf1 De sepultura\plain \f0\fs22\cf1 ), Anf. 15. Jh. (gleiche Glossenhand wie Berlin, SB, Ms. lat. fol. 343). \plain \f0\fs22 51\plain \f0\super\fs28 rb\plain \f0\fs22 -52\plain \f0\super\fs28 va\plain \f0\fs22  Nachtr\u228 \'e4ge (\plain \f0\i\fs22 De excommunicatione et de absolutione clericum parochialium; De correctione praelatorum; De daemonibus\plain \f0\fs22 ), zwei H\u228 \'e4nde, 2. H. 14. Jh. und um 1400. 52\plain \f0\super\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22  bis auf Schriftspiegellinierung leer.}

