\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1041\fs22 62\plain \f1\super\lang1041\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1041\fs22 -67\plain \f1\super\lang1041\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1041\fs22  [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1041\fs22\chcbpat17 Marinus de Eboli}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1041\fs22 :] {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1041\fs22\chcbpat17 Tractatus de revocatoriis}}\plain \f1\lang1041\fs22 . \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 \u8250 \'9bIncipit Tractatus de revocatoriis super appellationibus secundum cursum cancellarie.\u8249 \'8b {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1041\fs22\chcbpat17 Cum per inferiores iudices aliquid iniuste vel inprovide agitur superioris auctoritate debet in statum debitum revocari }}\plain \f1\i\lang1041\fs22 ... - ... prout ex qualitate personarum et causarum cognicione poterit committere pro sua industria fraudem vel iusticiam impetrans.\plain \f1\lang1041\fs22  \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 Ed.: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Herde, Marinus von Eboli, 1963}}\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 , S. 196-229 (Hs. nicht genannt). Von den gr\u246 \'f6\u223 \'dferen Textzus\u228 \'e4tzen der Kanzleihandschriften in vorliegender Hs nur die Zus\u228 \'e4tze bei {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Herde, Audientia, 1970}}\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 , Bd. 2, S. 199; 202; 212; 219; 221 \u252 \'fcberliefert.}

