\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1041\fs22 67\plain \f1\super\lang1041\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1041\fs22 -73\plain \f1\super\lang1041\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1041\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1041\fs22\chcbpat17 Conclusiones super revocatoriis}}\plain \f1\lang1041\fs22 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1041\fs22\chcbpat17 Mandamus quatinus, si dictam excommunicationis sententiam post appellationem huiusmodi inveneris esse latam vel promulgatam}}\plain \f1\i\lang1041\fs22  ... - ... Et nota quod quandocumque huiusmodi presentatio fit alii persone quam episcopo diocesano debet narrari ut supra\plain \f1\lang1041\fs22 . Ed.: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1041\fs22\chcbpat17 Herde, Autientia}}\plain \f1\lang1041\fs22 , Bd. 2, S. 494-539. 73\plain \f1\super\lang1041\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1041\fs22  leer.}

