\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 1\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 -149\plain \f0\super\fs28 va\plain \f0\fs22  \plain \f0\scaps\fs22 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Thaddaeus Alderottus}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 :] {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Glossae super libris Aphorismorum [Hippocratis}}\plain \f0\fs22 ]. Fragment am Anfang und Ende. Textbeginn (li. 1 und Anfang von li. 2) fehlen wegen Blattverlust (s.o.). \plain \f0\i\fs22 || quam purgare debemus ... -\plain \f0\fs22  (62\plain \f0\super\fs28 rb\plain \f0\fs22 ) \plain \f0\i\fs22 ... debilitas caloris naturalis et eius grossitudo.\plain \f0\fs22  \plain \f0\i\fs22 Expliciunt Glose secunde particule cum suis addicionibus. Sit laus Deo glorioso et benedicto. Amen. \plain \f0\fs22 Text (li. 3): \plain \f0\i\fs22 >Mutaciones temporum etc.< Cum Yppocrates in particula precedenti determinavit de accedentalibus ... \plain \f0\fs22 - (72\plain \f0\super\fs28 va\plain \f0\fs22 ) \plain \f0\i\fs22 ... duravit bene xx diebus.\plain \f0\fs22  \plain \f0\i\fs22 Expliciunt Glose super 3 particula quas corrigendo in eis fere\plain \f0\fs22  (72\plain \f0\super\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22 ) \plain \f0\i\fs22 nullas addiciones feci nec correxi ea intencione ut adderem sed solum propter vicium scriptorum eas sicco pede volui pertransire. Et ego poeta complevi eas scribere in vigilia Matheina de mense Decembris M\u176 \'b0CC\u176 \'b0LXXXII currente \plain \f0\fs22 [Textdatierung]\plain \f0\i\fs22 . \plain \f0\fs22 Text (li. 4): \plain \f0\i\fs22 >Pregnantes purgare etc.< In precedenti particula Yppocrates determinavit de causis morborum ... - \plain \f0\fs22 (104\plain \f0\super\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22 ) \plain \f0\i\fs22 ...\plain \f0\fs22  \plain \f0\i\fs22 potest esse verius. Et hec finiuntur Glose 4e particule cum suis addicionibus. \plain \f0\fs22 Text (li. 5): \plain \f0\i\fs22 >Spasmus ex elleboro mortalis<. In precedenti particula ... - \plain \f0\fs22 (131\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 ) \plain \f0\i\fs22 ... poteris invenire. \plain \f0\fs22 Text (li. 6): \plain \f0\i\fs22 >In diuturnis lienteriis<. Hec vi\plain \f0\i\super\fs28 a\plain \f0\i\fs22  particula valde male ... - ... sed asma et tussis sunt causa mortis et gibbus || \plain \f0\fs22 Text bricht wegen Blattverlust (s.o.) ab (Ende von li. 6 sowie li. 7 fehlen). Am Rand vereinzelt Glossen von mehreren H\u228 \'e4nden, 14./15. Jh. Ed.: Thaddei Florentini Expositiones Aphorismorum Hippocratis. Venetiis, 1527, 2\plain \f0\super\fs28 rb\plain \f0\fs22 -164\plain \f0\super\fs28 va\plain \f0\fs22 ; 173\plain \f0\super\fs28 rb\plain \f0\fs22 -189\plain \f0\super\fs28 va\plain \f0\fs22  (Textl\u252 \'fccken jeweils am Anfang und Ende sowie beim zweimaligen Wechsel von Haupt- und Erg\u228 \'e4nzungshand 133\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 /134\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22  und 149\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 /150\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ). Zu Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Thorndike/Kibre, Catalogue of Incipits, 1963}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Sp. 750; 789; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Kibre, Hippocrates Latinus, 1985}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 89f. \u220 \'dcberlieferung auch {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Cesena, BCom, Ms. D.XXIV.6}}\plain \f0\fs22 , 136\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 -247\plain \f0\super\fs28 va\plain \f0\fs22 , vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Manfron, La biblioteca di un medico, 1998}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 197f. (Verfasserzuweisung und gleiches Zwischenkolophon, aber dat. 1286 (!); Norditalien?, um 1300).}

