\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 150\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 -181\plain \f0\super\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22  \plain \f0\scaps\fs22 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Thaddaeus Alderottus}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Commentum] super [Libro] pronosticorum [Hippocratis}}\plain \f0\fs22 ]. Titel (\u252 \'fcbergeschrieben, um 1500): \plain \f0\i\fs22 Super pronosticorum\plain \f0\fs22 ). Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Amicorum copiam delectabilem et gloriosam permittit}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... et medici reales et medici racionales qui sciunt in utroque.\plain \f0\fs22  Zum Werk vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Thorndike/Kibre, Catalogue of Incipits, 1963}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Sp. 90; 820; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Kibre, Hippocrates Latinus, 1985}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 221. \u220 \'dcberlieferung auch {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Cesena, BCom, Ms. D.XXIV.6}}\plain \f0\fs22 , 247\plain \f0\super\fs28 va\plain \f0\fs22 -259\plain \f0\super\fs28 va\plain \f0\fs22   (Norditalien?, um 1300), vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Manfron, La bibliotheca di un medico, 1998}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 197f.. Am Rand vereinzelt Korrekturen von Schreiberhand.}

