\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 1\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 -252\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 H[enricus] de Turego}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22  [sive Pseudo-]{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Henricus de Gandavo}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 : [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Abbreviatio sive] Excerpta ex Bonaventura Super libris Sententiarum}}\plain \f0\fs22 . Prolog: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Veritates questionum ex opere Bonaventure super librum Sentenciarum pro modulo }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 (!) }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 intelligencie mee}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17  (am Rand erg\u228 \'e4nzt von zeitgen\u246 \'f6ssischer Hand }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 ad instanciam fratrum}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 )}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17  extrahere cupiens}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - \plain \f0\fs22 (1\plain \f0\super\fs28 rb\plain \f0\fs22 ) \plain \f0\i\fs22 ... et per patrum sentencias confirmavit.\plain \f0\fs22  Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Habitis preambulis accedendum est ad librum, de quo sciendum est, quod ille liber Sententiarum quattuor habet libros}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ...\plain \f0\fs22  (38\plain \f0\super\fs28 rb\plain \f0\fs22 ) Zwischenkolophon (Ende li. I): \plain \f0\i\fs22 >Et finiunt Excerpta ex Bonaventura super primo Sentenciarum libro. Martinus< ...\plain \f0\fs22  (101\plain \f0\super\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22 ) Zwischenkolophon (Ende. li. II): \plain \f0\i\fs22 Hec distinccio in multis locis utile est. Et in hoc finitur 2us liber Sententiarum in profesto exaltacionis sancte crucis \plain \f0\fs22 [13. Sept. 1458, s.u.]\plain \f0\i\fs22  in Wiblingen. Frater Martinus Ymler de Gyslingen \plain \f0\fs22 ... (151\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 ) Zwischenkolophon (Ende. li. III): \plain \f0\i\fs22 Et in hoc finitur liber tercius. Benedictus Deus. >Feria 3\plain \f0\i\super\fs28 a\plain \f0\i\fs22  ante festum Sancti Martini \plain \f0\fs22 [8. Nov. 1458, s.u.] \plain \f0\i\fs22 per fratrum Martinum Gyslinger\plain \f0\fs22 < ... -\plain \f0\i\fs22  \plain \f0\fs22 (251\plain \f0\super\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22 ) \plain \f0\i\fs22 ... apparebimus cum ipso in gloria. Ad quam nos perducat pontifex et preceptor noster ... per infinita seculorum secula. Amen.\plain \f0\fs22  (252\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 ) Kolophon: \plain \f0\i\fs22 Hec ego frater H. de ordine minorum fratrum eiusdem ordinis in Thurego lector existens\plain \f0\fs22  (dar\u252 \'fcber von Schreiberhand \plain \f0\i\fs22 Creduntur Excerpta per fratrem Hainricum de Gandavo ordinis fratrum minorum\plain \f0\fs22 ) \plain \f0\i\fs22 ex opere Bonaventure abbreviando conscripsi ... Finit Excerptum Bonaventure super quarto Sententiarum iiii Ydus Aprilis \plain \f0\fs22 [9. April 1459, s.u.] \plain \f0\i\fs22 per fratrem Martinum Ymler de Gyslingen, qui post alios plures eciam hunc ex iniuncta sibi obediencia librum conscripsit ad honorem Dei et sui matris. \plain \f0\fs22 Danach Versus (Kolophon):\plain \f0\i\fs22  Post annos domini millenos quaterque centenos / Ac quinquaginta novem baiolant fratres bene iugum / Augentur predia, struuntur domus et vasa / Plures e fratribus propriis manibusque laborant / Conscribunt codices, conligant rectificantque / E quibus minimus Martinus statura pusillus / Conscripsit plures, ligavit ac illuminavit / Sudoris premium petit sequacium oramen / Labores nostros quisquis dissipare presumpsit / Ultur invincibilis vindictam feret ingratis.\plain \f0\fs22  Am Rand und im Text Korrekturen und Nachtr\u228 \'e4ge der beiden Schreiberh\u228 \'e4nde sowie zwei weiteren zeitgen\u246 \'f6ssischen H\u228 \'e4nden. Zu Verfasser, Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 VL (2)}}\plain \f0\fs22\cf1 , Bd. 3, Sp. 927 ('Heinrich von Z\u252 \'fcrich'; Hs genannt; Lit.); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Stegm\u252 \'fcller, RS}}\plain \f0\fs22\cf1 , Nr. 320 ('Henricus Goeckelmann de Isny'; Hs genannt); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 MBK}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Bd. 1, S. 427; 439; 441 ('Henricus de Gandavo'; Hs genannt).\plain \f0\fs22\cf1  252\plain \f0\super\fs28\cf1 rb\plain \f0\fs22\cf1 -252\plain \f0\super\fs28\cf1 v\plain \f0\fs22\cf1  leer.}

