\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 1\plain \f0\super\fs28 va\plain \f0\fs22 -68\plain \f0\super\fs28 va\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Guibertus de Novigento}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Dei gesta per Francos}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 .\plain \f0\fs22  Widmungsprolog: \plain \f0\i\fs22 >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Patri et domino sanct\u281 e Suessionensis \u281 ecclesi\u281 e episcopo Lisiardo Guibertus ... Cum ab amicis< michi suggereretur }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 (korr. aus }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 suggeretur}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 )}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 aliquibus}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... -\plain \f0\fs22  (1\plain \f0\super\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22 ) \plain \f0\i\fs22 ... pro perhenni tui nominis monimento retineas. \plain \f0\fs22 Titel: \plain \f0\i\fs22 >Finit Epistola. Proemium in libro Dei gestorum per Francos<.\plain \f0\fs22  Text: \plain \f0\i\fs22 >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Ad pr\u281 esentis opusculi< exsecutionem }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 (!) }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 multum michi prebuit}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... -\plain \f0\fs22  (3\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 ) \plain \f0\i\fs22 ... honori proficeat, scilicet Dei gesta per Francos.\plain \f0\fs22  Titel: \plain \f0\i\fs22 >Explicit Proemium. Liber primus Dei gestorum per Francos incipit<.\plain \f0\fs22  (3\plain \f0\super\fs28 rb\plain \f0\fs22 ) Text: \plain \f0\i\fs22 >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Quorumdam }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 (!) }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 mortalium< viciose aliquotiens, sed non semper, moribus constat inolitum}}\plain \f0\fs22  ...\plain \f0\i\fs22  - ... Deus ergo tandem pio labori limes >assistat. Explicit liber septimus Dei gestorum per Francos<.\plain \f0\fs22  Ed.: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 CCCM}}\plain \f0\fs22\cf1 , Bd. 127A, S. 85-352. Zu Verfasser, Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. ebd., S. 1-75 (Hs auf S. 45f. mit Sigle B\plain \f0\sub\fs28\cf1 2\plain \f0\fs22\cf1  genannt). Am Rand sowie im Text Korrekturen und Erg\u228 \'e4nzungen von Schreiberhand.}

