\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 49\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -60\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Poggius [Bracciolinus}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 ]\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Epistula ad Franciscum Barbarum contra Guarinum [Veronensem de Scipione et Julio Caesare}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 ].\plain \f0\i\fs22 >Sequitur Defensio ipsius Poggii seu Replicatio confirmativa ad responsionem Guarini prefato Francisco Barbaro legata, ut super controversia diiudicet<. \plain \f0\fs22 (49\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 >Nuper< cum exercendi ingenii causa, mi Francisce}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... que a probatissimis auctoribus referuntur. Vale et parce longitudini mee. Explicit.\plain \f0\fs22  Ed.: Riccardo Fubini (Hg.): Poggio Bracciolini: Opera omnia, Bd. 1. Torino 1964, S. 365-390. Am Rand Glossen von Schreiberhand.}

