\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 102\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -204\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22  [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Thomas Cantimpratensis}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 :] {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Bonum universale de apibus}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 .\plain \f0\fs22  \plain \f0\i\fs22 >Incipit liber qui dicitur de proprietatibus apium seu Bonum universale apium<. \plain \f0\fs22 Prolog: \plain \f0\i\fs22 >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Reverendo< in Christo patri fratri Humberto magistro}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ...\plain \f0\fs22  Text: \plain \f0\i\fs22 >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Unum< caput esse Christi in unitate ecclesie fideles habent}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - \plain \f0\fs22 (203\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ) \plain \f0\i\fs22 ... illos tanquam \plain \f0\fs22 (!) \plain \f0\i\fs22 me participes faciat Jhesus Christus dominus noster, qui cum patre et spiritu sancto vivit et regnat, Deus per omnia secula seculorum. >Amen<. \plain \f0\fs22 Am Ende (203\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ) nachgetragener Verweis auf Edition Douai [1605 oder 1627], Anf. 17. Jh. (203\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -204\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ) Inhaltsverzeichnis von Schreiberhand. Am Rand Glossen und Erg\u228 \'e4nzungen von Schreiberhand sowie einer weiteren Hand, Humanistica, Anf. 16. Jh.}

