\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 1\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 -289\plain \f0\super\fs28 rb\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Bartholomaeus Anglicus}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 De proprietatibus rerum}}\plain \f0\fs22 . Prolog: \plain \f0\i\fs22 >Incipit Prohemium in Libro de proprietatibus rerum<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Cum proprietatibus rerum sequantur substantias}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... \plain \f0\fs22 (1\plain \f0\super\fs28 rb\plain \f0\fs22 ) Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 De proprietatibus itaque et naturis rerum tam spiritualium quam corporalium elucidare aliqua cupientes}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ...\plain \f0\fs22  \plain \f0\i\fs22 -\plain \f0\fs22  (283\plain \f0\super\fs28 va\plain \f0\fs22 ) \plain \f0\i\fs22 ... qui est Deus sublimis et gloriosus, vivens et regnans in secula seculorum. Amen. \plain \f0\fs22 (283\plain \f0\super\fs28 va\plain \f0\fs22 -283\plain \f0\super\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22 ) Autorenverzeichnis. Kolophon:\plain \f0\i\fs22  >Explicit Tractatus de proprietatibus rerum editus a fratre Bartholomeo Anglico ordinis fratrum minorum<.\plain \f0\fs22  (283\plain \f0\super\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22 -289\plain \f0\super\fs28 rb\plain \f0\fs22 ) Alphabetisches Sachregister ('Abana', vgl. dazu Meyer, Bartholom\u228 \'e4us Anglicus, 2000, S. 200f.). (289\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 ) Kolophon (von anderer Hand): \plain \f0\i\fs22 Henricus dictus scriptor libri fuit huius. Natus in Hanonia iuxta montes fuit ille, in quadam villa, que castellum datur esse \plain \f0\fs22 [Casteau bei Mons/Hennegau, zu einem 1297-1299 als Schreiber in Paris t\u228 \'e4tigen Henricus de Mons vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[3].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Rouse, Manuscripts and their makers, 2000}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 50]\plain \f0\i\fs22 . Huic mater Christi virgo velit auxiliari, ne Satanas animam post mortem deferat eius, sed celi patriam penetrans congaudeat intus. Amen.\plain \f0\fs22  Kolophon: \plain \f0\i\fs22 >Explicit Liber de proprietatibus rerum<. \plain \f0\fs22 Ed.: Christel Meier u.a. (Hgg.): Bartholoaeus Anglicus: De proprietatibus rerum. Bd. 1; Bd. 6. Turnhout 2007 (nur Proh.; li. I-IV; XVII); Bartholomaeus Anglicus: De rerum proprietatibus. Frankfurt/Main 1601 (ND Frankfurt/Main 1964). Zu Verfasser, Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 CALMA}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Bd. 1, S. 684f. (Lit.); Meyer, Bartholom\u228 \'e4us Anglicus, 2000, passim; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Stegm\u252 \'fcller, RB}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Nr. 1564; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Glorieux, Facult\u233 \'e9, 1971}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Nr. 48a. Randglossen (Standardausstattung, vgl. Meyer, Bartholom\u228 \'e4us Anglicus, 2000, S. 208-211) von Schreiberhand. Kapitelverweise ebenfalls vom Schreiber (von diesem auch das Register). 289\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22  bis auf Schriftspiegellinierung leer.}

