\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 13\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -16\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22  \plain \f0\scaps\fs22 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Petrus Klitzke}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Collatio] de reformatione universitatis Lipsensis}}\plain \f0\fs22 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Venerabiles patres ... Si quid unquam maximo desiderio expectivi}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... ad quecumque utiliora universitatis benivole intendere et laborare etc.\plain \f0\fs22  Ed. (Ausz\u252 \'fcge): {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Wejwoda, Bocksdorf, 2012}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 365-367 (dat. Leipzig, 1446; Hs genannt). Am Rand Glossen von Rodevo\u223 \'df (Ausarbeitung als Musterrede). Urspr\u252 \'fcnglich folgend auf Berlin, SB, Ms. boruss. fol. 719.}

