\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 34\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -35\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22  \plain \f0\scaps\fs22 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Johannes de Halberstadt}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 ]: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Sermo [in exequiis] Andreae de Broda}}\plain \f0\fs22 . Titel: >Sermo defunctorum<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Mortuus est in senectute bona scilicet Abraham. Gen. xxv }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 (Gn 25,8) (von Rodevo\u223 \'df erg\u228 \'e4nzt)}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 . Eciam, si mortuus fuerit, vivet. Reverende pater, magistri ac domini mei prestantissimi. Cogitanti }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 (korr. aus }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Cogitante}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 )}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17  michi de morte beatissime memorie magistri Andree de Broda}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... sicut Lazarus denuo vixit rursus citatus, sed vivet vita glorie. Quam vitam nobis \plain \f0\fs22 (erg\u228 \'e4nzt \plain \f0\i\fs22 omnibus prestare dignetur Jhesus Christus in secula seculorum benedictus. Amen.\plain \f0\fs22  Zum Werk vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Schneyer, Repertorium 2, 1990-1994}}\plain \f0\fs22 , s.v. 'Johannes de Halberstadt OP', Nr. 2 (dat. Leipzig, 25. Okt. 1427); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Kaeppeli, ScriptOP, 1970}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Nr. 2380. Am Rand vereinzelt Glossen von Rodevo\u223 \'df. Urspr\u252 \'fcnglich folgend auf Berlin, SB, Ms. lat. fol. 305 (XIV).}

