\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 45\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 -49\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22  \plain \f0\scaps\fs22 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Quaestiones theologicales Lipsenses}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 ]\plain \f0\fs22 . Sammlung von zwei Qu\u228 \'e4stionen. Nr. 1 (45\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 -49\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 >Utrum sacerdos obligatus ad faciendum suffragium pro uno. Satisfaciat eidem applicacio ...<}}\plain \f0\fs22  Nr. 2 (49\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 ) Summe mit Nennung der Leipziger Disputenden [ca. 1446-1450] (s.o.); Nachtrag von Rodevo\u223 \'df: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Utrum sacrum eukaristie non sumendum sub specie aliena}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ...\plain \f0\fs22  Am Rand Glossen von Rodevo\u223 \'df.}

