\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 50\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -54\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Johannes Bremer}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Sermo in die coenae [domini}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 ].\plain \f0\fs22  Leipzig, 1420. Titel: \plain \f0\i\fs22 Sermo factus in die cene per fratrem Johannem Bremer lectorem secundarium ordinis minorum in Lipzk anno domini 1420. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 >Tu es sacerdos in eternum }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 (Ps 109,4)}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 <. Verba ista Psalterio 109 exarata}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... per misericordiam eius dabitur timentibus cum eterna merces, quam mercedem nobis concedat Jhesus Christus, qui cum eodem domino et spiritu sancto, sacerdos in eternum, vivit et regnat. Amen.\plain \f0\fs22  Zu Verfasser (Prof. theol. Leipzig, 1420-1424) und Werk vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 VL (2)}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Bd. 1, Sp. 1018-1023, v.a. 1021f. (Hs als Unikat genannt). Am Rand vereinzelt Glossen und Nachtr\u228 \'e4ge von Rodevo\u223 \'df. Nach dem Text von Rodevo\u223 \'df nachgetragene Exzerpte (\plain \f0\i\fs22 metrice ... pro laude alicuius facienda\plain \f0\fs22 ) aus {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Alanus [ab Insulis}}\plain \f0\fs22 ]: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Anticlaudianus}}\plain \f0\fs22  (V,8). Ed.: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 PL}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Bd. 210, Sp. 537f. 54\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22  leer.}

