\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 79\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 -81\plain \f0\super\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22 . 82\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 -82\plain \f0\super\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22  \plain \f0\scaps\fs22 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat18 Novellae Justiniani sive Authenticum Glossatum}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 ]\plain \f0\fs22 . Fr\u252 \'fche Bologneser Redaktion. Zwei Fragmente (Nov. 8.13-10.11 [79\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 -81\plain \f0\super\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22 ]; 70; 69.pr-2 [82\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 -82\plain \f0\super\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22 ]). Ed.: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat18 Corpus iuris civilis 3, 1899}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 76-93; 355f.; 349-351 (gedoppelte Passagen gegen\u252 \'fcber dem vorherigen Text). Zu Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat18 Loschiavo, Summa codicis Berolinensis, 1996}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 11-13. Am Rand Glossen, mindestens zwei H\u228 \'e4nde, Bologna, letztes Dr. 12. Jh. (vgl. ebd., S. 12f.). Ehemals Teil von {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat18 M\u252 \'fcnchen, SB, Clm 3509 (II)}}\plain \f0\fs22  (Oberitalien?, E. 12. Jh. vgl. ebd., S. 11; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat18 M SB Illum. 6.1}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Nr. 39). Handwechsel.}

