\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 91\plain \f0\super\fs28 va\plain \f0\fs22 -110\plain \f0\super\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22  \plain \f0\scaps\fs22 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Epitome Juliani}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 ]\plain \f0\fs22 . Gek\u252 \'fcrzte Fassung. Fragment (c. 1-161; 398-528 = Const. I-XXXVI; CX-CXXII.2) durch Blattverlust im Inneren (102\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 /103\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ) sowie am Ende. Titel: \plain \f0\i\fs22 >In nomine domini incipit Novellarum liber domini Justiniani serenissimi imperatoris Constantinopolitani<.\plain \f0\fs22  Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 In Digestis et in Constitutionibus didicimus}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... de officio eius exact[or sit]\plain \f0\fs22  (von sp\u228 \'e4terer Hand erg\u228 \'e4nzt)\plain \f0\i\fs22  ||\plain \f0\fs22  Text bricht wegen Blattverlust ab. Ed.: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Haenel, Iuliani epitome, 1873}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 1-67; 137-170. Zu Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Loschiavo, Summa codicis Berolinensis, 1996}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 14; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[3].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Kaiser, Epitome, 2004}}\plain \f0\fs22 , passim (Hs auf S. 310 (Anm.\~305) genannt). Am Rand vereinzelt Glossen, mehrere H\u228 \'e4nde, 13. und 15. Jh. Handwechsel.}

