rl Kibre: Hippocrates Latinus: Repertorium of Hippocratic Writings in the Latin Middle Ages (III). In: Traditio 33 (1977), S. 253\endash 295, hier: S. 284-289 (VII,1); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Thorndike/Kibre, Catalogue of Incipits, 1963}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 , Sp. 453f.; 309. \u220 \'dcberlieferung auch {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Berlin, SB, Hdschr. 381}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 , 174\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28\cf1 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \endash 177\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28\cf1 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 , vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 B SB Kat. 9.1}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 , S. 132f.}

