\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 52\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \endash 82\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Tabulae astronomicae}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 . (52\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28\cf1 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Tabula oppositionum mediarum solis et lunae, medii motus solis, argumenti solis et lunae et argumenti latitudinis lunae in mensibus (\endash 1481). Fragment am Anfang durch Blattverlust (s. o.). (53\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28\cf1 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Tabula aequationis solis. (54\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28\cf1 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Tabula aequationis lunae. (55\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Tabulae longitudinis in minutis et veri motus solis in una hora. (55\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \endash 57\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Tabula temporis longitudinis iuxta verum motum solis in una hora. (57\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Radices medii motus capitis draconis ad annos domini 1449\endash 1481. (57\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \endash 58\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Tabula medii motus capitis draconis ad menses et ad dies. (58\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \endash 59\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Tabula eclipsis solis in longitudine aequali. (60\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Tabula figurarum eclipsium solis et lunae iuxta puncta quantitatum. (62\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28\cf1 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Tabula medii motus solis in horis et minutis. (62\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Tabula medii motus solis in annis Christi. (63\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \endash 73\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Tabulae medii motus planetarum in diebus mensium. (73\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Motus octavae sphaerae in diebus mensium, in mensibus in anno communi, in mensibus in anno bisextili. Radices augium planetarum sine motu octavae sphaerae. (74\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Medius accessus et recessus octavae sphaerae in annis Christi. (74\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Motus augium stellarum fixarum in annis Christi. (75\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Tabula aequationis accessus et recessus octavae sphaerae. (75\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \endash 76\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Tabulae aequationis solis. (77\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \endash 79\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Tabulae aequationis lunae. (79\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \endash 80\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Tabulae aequationis Saturni. (80\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \endash 82\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Tabulae aequationis Jovis. (82\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Radices Argentinesis (!) pro tabulis quae incipiunt in Martio. Am Rand zahlreiche astronomische, grammatische und theologische Glossen sowie Rezepte, v. a. f\u252 \'fcr Kr\u228 \'e4uterw\u228 \'e4sser, gegen Ge\-schwuls\-te, Geisteskrankheiten u. a., dt. und vereinzelt lat.}

