\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 205\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \endash 238\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28\cf1 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Albericus [Londoniensis}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ]: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Poetarius [sive Scintillarium poetarum}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 , cap. 1\endash 14. \u220 \'dcbergeschrieben: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Sanctissima Dei genitrix.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  (205\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28\cf1 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Prolog 1: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Multa viri veteres cum scribendo sibi gloriam habere ... Fabularum ergo quarum nomen}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1  ... pene figmenta manaverunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  (Ed.: Jacobi Revii Daventriae illustratae sive historiae urbis Daventriensis libri sex. Leiden 1651, S. 141f.). (205\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Prolog 2: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Fuit vir in Egipto ditissimus nomine Sirophanes}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1  ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Saturnus primus deorum. Ut autem deinceps inexplicitos aliquot antiquitatis revolvamus errores}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1  ... \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 (236\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ... caudam serpentis habebat etc. etc. etc. Explicit Poetarius Albrici plurimum intellectui poetarum deserviens.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  Ed.: Georg Heinrich Bode: Scriptores rerum mythicarum latini tres Romae nuper reperti. Zelle 1834, S. 152f. (ohne Prologe); Kathleen O. Elliott / J. P. Elder: A Critical Edition of the Vatican Mythographers. In: Transactions and Proceedings of the American Philological Association 78 (1947), S. 189\endash 207, hier: S. 203\endash 207. Zu Verfasser, Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. ebd., S. 205\endash 207; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Sharpe, Handlist}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 , S. 35 (Lit.). (236\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \endash 238\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28\cf1 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Register, mit Vorbemerkung: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Cum singuli poetice artis tractatores sua scripta poematum ... \endash  ... ad hoc iuxta litterarum ordinem registracionem confeci etc. etc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  (237\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28\cf1 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \endash 238\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28\cf1 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Register. (238\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28\cf1 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Explicit Registrum premisse poetrie.}

