\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 256\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28\cf1 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \endash 323\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28\cf1 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Guido de Monte Rocherii}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Manipulus curatorum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 . (256\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28\cf1 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \endash 256\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28\cf1 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Kapitel\-verzeich\-nis. (257\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28\cf1 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Titel von anderer Hand: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Sacramentale Guidonis de Monte Rocherii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 . Widmungsbrief: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Dedicatio: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Reverendo in Christo patri ac domino domino Raymundo divina providencia sancte sedis Valencie episcopo suorum devotorum minimus Guido de Monte Rocherii}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1  ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  (257\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28\cf1 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Prologus: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Quoniam secundum quod dicit propheta Malachias}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1  ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  (257\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28\cf1 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8250 \'9bIncipit libellus quidem Manipulus curatorum qui habet tres partes\u8249 \'8b. Dividitur ergo presens opusculum in tres partes ... \u8250 \'9bSequitur de prima parte\u8249 \'8b. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Quantum ad primam partem primo videbuntur aliqua de sacramentis in generali}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1  ...   \endash  ... Et pro me peccatore ad dominum preces fundat etc. Explicit Manipulus curatorum Deo gracias. Amen. Ferrarie Anno domini Mccccxxxviii ubi tunc Deus noster Eugenius papa quartus ycumenicum (!) consilium celebravit etc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  Zu Verfasser, Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Stegm\u252 \'fcller, RB}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 , Nr. 277; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Bloomfield/Guyot, Incipits, 1979}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 , Nr. 5019 (m. Suppl.; Lit.); Horacio Santiago-Otero: Manuscritos de autores medievales hispanos, Bd. 1. Madrid 1987 (Medievalia et humanistica 3), S. 53\endash 66.}

