\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs32 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 \endash 70\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs32 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Haly filius Abbas}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 :] {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Liber Pantegni}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , lat. von {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Constantinus Africanus}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 . \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs32 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Kopftitel (Nachtrag, 15. Jh): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Liber Theorice Constantini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs32 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Titel: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 \u8250 \'9bIn nomine sancte trinitatis incipit liber Pantegni id est ars ingens medicine universalis unde versus: Omnia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 constringens speculatrix incipit ingens: Ars per quam vere valeas operando valere. A Constancino verbo translata latino.\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs32 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 \endash 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs32 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Widmung: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 \u8250 \'9bHic incipit prologus Constantini Affricani montis Cassinencis mo[nachi]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Domino suo Montis Cassianensis abbati Desiderio \u8230 \'85 Cum totius pater sciencie generalitas tres principales habeat partes, omnes enim seculares}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 \u8230 \'85 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Prolog: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Auctoritas Ypocratis quales debeant esse dicipuli.\u8249 \'8b Oportet qui medicine vult obtinere habitum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  \u8230 \'85 -  ... secundum morbi diuturnitatem, unde acutum oportet habere sensum ad intelligendum. Explicit Theorica Pantegni\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . Ed.: Opera omnia Ysaac ... Lyon 1515, Bd. 2, Bl. 1\endash 144. Zu Verfasser, Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. Charles Burnett / Danielle Jacquart: Constantine the African ... The \lquote Pan\-teg\-ni\rquote  and related Texts. Leiden u. a. 1994 (Studies in Ancient Medicine 10), S.\~317\endash 351 (Hs auf S.\~320 genannt); CALMA, Bd. 3, S. 19f. (Nr. 22); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Thorndike/Kibre, Catalogue of Incipits, 1963}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Sp. 466; 348; 1011; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Hamesse/Szyller, Repertorium, 2007\endash 2009}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Nr. 13103; 10693. Am Rand vereinzelt Nachtr\u228 \'e4ge von Schreiberhand, dazu vereinzelt Glossen einer Hand, E. 15. Jh., sowie einmal Karikatur (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ).}

