\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 1\plain \f4\super\lang1033\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 \endash 14\plain \f4\super\lang1033\fs28 rb\plain \f0\fs22  \plain \f4\scaps\lang1033\fs22 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f4\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Aristoteles}}\plain \f4\scaps\lang1033\fs22 :] {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f4\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 De generatione et corruptione}}\plain \f4\scaps\lang1033\fs22 . \plain \f0\fs22 [Translatio nova von\plain \f4\scaps\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f4\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Guilelmus de Moerbeka}}\plain \f4\scaps\lang1033\fs22 ]\plain \f0\fs22 . Fragment am Anfang. || \plain \f4\i\lang1033\fs22 Illud autem cuius hec ultima materia\plain \f0\fs22  \plain \f4\i\lang1033\fs22 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85\~talis qualis contingit esse corruptibilis. Explicit Liber de generatione et corruptione. \plain \f0\fs22 Ed. (Teilausgabe der Translatio nova): Sancti Thomae Aquinatis doctoris Angelici opera omnia iussu impensaque Leonis XIII., Bd. 3: Commentaria in libros Aristotelis de caelo et mundo .... Rom 1886, S. 307, Z.\~3 \endash  S. 320. Ed. (Translatio vetus): Joanna Judycka (Hg.): Aristoteles Latinus, Bd.\~9,1: De generatione et corruptione. Leiden 1986, S. 27, Z. 9 \endash  S. 81. Zu Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Aristoteles latinus}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Bd. 1,1, S. 130\endash 132; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Thorndike/Kibre, Catalogue of Incipits, 1963}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Sp. 374; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Sch\u246 \'f6nberger, Repertorium (2), 2011}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S.\~583 (A9600-100). Am Rand sowie zwischen den Zeilen zahlreiche Glossen sowie vereinzelte Nachtr\u228 \'e4ge, drei H\u228 \'e4nde, 2. Dr. 14. Jh.}

