\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 37\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 \endash 44\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 va\plain \f0\fs22  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Aristoteles}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 : Libri tres De somno]\plain \f0\fs22 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 \u8250 \'9bIncipit Liber de sompno \plain \f0\fs22 (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 et vigilia.\u8249 \'8b \plain \f0\fs22 Zu allen drei Werken vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Sch\u246 \'f6nberger, Repertorium (2), 2011}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 582 (A9600-130). (37\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 -40\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 rb\plain \f0\fs22 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 De somno et vigilia}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 .\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 De sompno }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 (!) }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 autem et vigilia quid sint, et utrum proprie sint anime vel corporis vel communia}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 propter salutem vero est: salvat enim quies. \plain \f0\fs22 Anfangs Mischfassung aus der Translatio vetus und der Translatio nova, im weiteren Verlauf st\u228 \'e4rker der Translatio nova folgend, stets mit eigenen Varianten. Ed. (Translatio vetus et nova): Hendrik Joan Drossaart Lulofs (Hg.): Aristotelis De somno et vigilia liber adiectis veteribus translationibus et Theodori Metochitae Commentario. Leiden 1943, S. 1*\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 \endash \plain \f0\fs22 10*. Zum Werk vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Thorndike/Kibre, Catalogue of Incipits, 1963}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Sp. 391; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Hamesse/Szyller, Repertorium, 2007\endash 2009}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Nr. 11595 (vgl. auch Nr. 11600; 11602\endash 11604). (40\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 rb\plain \f0\fs22 \endash 43\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 De insomniis}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 .\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Post hec de sompno\~}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 (!) }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 querendum et primo cui eorum que sunt anime et passio videatur inesse}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 secundum passionem necessarium accidere contrarietatem hanc. \plain \f0\fs22 Haupts\u228 \'e4chlich Translatio vetus, jedoch mit Elementen der Translatio nova und eigenen Varianten. Ed.: Hendrik Joan Drossaart Lulofs: Aristotelis De insomniis et De divinatione per somnum. A new edition of the Greek text with the Latin translation, Bd. 2: Translations. Index verborum. Leiden 1947 (Philosophia antiqua 2,2), S. 2\endash 31 (Translatio vetus und Translatio nova). Zum Werk vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Thorndike/Kibre, Catalogue of Incipits, 1963}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Sp. 1063; Hamesse/Szyller, Repertorium, 2007\endash 2009, Nr. 24011. (43\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 \endash 44\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 va\plain \f0\fs22 ) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[2].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 De divinatione per somnum}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 , \plain \f0\fs22 Translatio nova von {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Guilelmus de Moerbeka}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 ].\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 De divinacione vero, que in sompnis fit et dicitur accidere in sompnis}}\plain \f0\fs22  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 et propter quam causam utrumque horum fit, amplius autem de ea que in sompniis \plain \f0\fs22 (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 est divinacione dictum est. Explicit de sompno \plain \f0\fs22 (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 . \plain \f0\fs22 Mit mehreren Varianten, selten aus der Translatio vetus. Ed.: Aristotelis De insomniis ... (s. o.), S. 33\endash 47 (Translatio vetus und Translatio nova). Zum Werk vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Thorndike/Kibre, Catalogue of Incipits, 1963}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Sp. 371; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Hamesse/Szyller, Repertorium, 2007\endash 2009}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Nr. 11132.}

